Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:29.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好 小伙子们 看起来早餐有冰冻寿司吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,别乱蹦 看这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:55.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,看见这狮子吗? 过来抓他 就是你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,儿子 如果你想长大以后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:05.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,像你老爹一样 你一定要学会如何搏斗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:06.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,大大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:11.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯 我给你看点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:13.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看见这记号了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:16.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和我是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:19.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你长大以后 你会和我一样变成一只狮王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:22.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在让我看看你是怎么搏斗的 准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:25.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 阿拉凯 不准跳舞!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:28.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还真自得其乐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:33.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是个奇怪的小孩 真是奇怪的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们再来试一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样 阿拉凯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:40.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,停下来 别这样!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:43.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,果然望子成龙 却总是让人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:47.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,马库加 你还想挑战我?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:51.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,往好处想 等我击败你当了狮王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:54.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就可以整天陪着你那不成材的儿子了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:02:00.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,揍得你屁滚尿流之前 我先问问你:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:02.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么总是想当狮王?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:06.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我比你帅 发型比你美 智商也高过你...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:08.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,...我还想让所有人对我唯命是从
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,数到三 我就上了 一...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:17.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,注意 阿拉凯 看着老爸是怎么教训他的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:18.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,二 三!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁才是狮王?  - 当然是你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:45.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可别再健忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:48.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,看好了 阿拉凯 这才叫实力...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:51.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.47,0:02:53.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,(动物保护区  禁止捕猎)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:03:00.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了 过来 小猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,长得还真神气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:05.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来能值几个钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:08.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,手到擒来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:12.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:14.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯! 阿拉凯!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:16.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:21.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,大大!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要啊! 不要啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:27.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:41.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸!  - 爸爸来了! 别怕!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,大大!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:13.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:38.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,《马达加斯加2：逃往非洲》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:57.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,(捕鱼捞起小狮子)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:30.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不喜欢他的样子 - 我觉得他蛮可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:32.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得他是个显摆鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得他可爱?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗷!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:53.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约之王...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,...雄狮阿历克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是觉得他是个显摆鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯定的嘛 他是个动物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:05.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许他需要轻松一下 我们也需要度个假什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:07.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,少来了 我们能去哪里度假?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:11.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道你要去哪 我可想去康涅狄格州
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:15.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,包括世界闻名的雄狮阿历克斯在内的几只动物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚从中央动物园逃脱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.81,0:06:22.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,动物们被追逃进了中央车站
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是只讨厌的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:28.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,动物保护组织曾说服动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,将动物们送去非洲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们如今惊讶的获知 运载动物们去非洲的货船
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:35.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天据悉在海上失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:39.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚 数百纽约市民在动物园聚集
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:42.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,哀悼他们喜爱的动物们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:46.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人心中都有同一个疑问  他们现在在哪呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:40.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家一起来 你们都会唱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:45.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会想念你们这些小毛球的 你们真是好听众
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:48.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,很荣幸能教会你们如何用马桶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:51.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你们要来曼哈顿拜访 随时给我们打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:55.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,说真的 一定要先打电话 好不好?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:59.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静点 诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不尝尝这个就走可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,很惊喜吧 怪咖们!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:06.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,摇起来 摇起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:10.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,看 我是个美女 我是个美女 大家看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:14.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是个美女 假的啦 是我 朱利安国王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:18.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁被我迷倒啦? 举手看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:26.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,怪咖们 你们肯定很开心  因为国王我要和你们一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 免了 多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能免 多谢 那是我的飞机!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:38.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我从新大陆带回纪念品之前...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:41.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,...史迪威是老大!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:48.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得他们不太喜欢这个主意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:50.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么 史迪威?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:53.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以吗? 不是吧! 这怎么可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:01.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是小淘气! 史迪威说...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,把蛋糕给他们吃吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:06.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,朱利安国王 等等我!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:10.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经收拾好了! 旅程也计划好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:13.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 是莫特! 烦人的家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让他上来 抓住他!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:18.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,他带着剪刀和护手霜!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:25.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都进去 快点 快进去!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:27.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 支架 - 检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:28.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 机翼 - 检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:29.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 引擎 咖啡机 - 检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些傻瓜!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,想都别想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:41.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这肯定是我见过的第二大的弹弓了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过没办法啦 全体注意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是机长
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:48.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦发生紧急情况 请穿上救生夹克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后和这个世界说再见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约 我们来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,请向各路神仙祈祷这破烂能飞起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,各路神仙? 破烂? 说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:00.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,启动了 机长
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,开门! 我还没进去!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果机舱失压
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,请戴上面具 别让人看见你吓得要死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:13.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 小姐 这带子不该是连在座位上的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是 先生 - 好了 小伙子们 发射!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:18.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,发射!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:20.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 发射!  - 发射!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,有鬼!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 莫特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:09.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:14.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:18.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有人还没睡醒 - 我觉得我刚才看见莫特在机翼上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你太想念马达加斯加了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:21.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定会想的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:26.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,那儿是很不错 不过我觉得 我们离的越远记忆越美好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:27.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪种美好? 就像你咬了我屁股那样?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把你念念不忘的这事用在舞台上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,算是我的沙拉吧台上的情感点心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:39.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的屁股也算是吧台上的点心吗?  (上集阿历克斯曾因饥饿咬了马蒂的屁股)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不必处处讽刺我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:46.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我们回去了 我想要参加相亲计划
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:48.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,相亲计划?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:51.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经够年纪谈婚论嫁了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该安定下来 发展一段感情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.87,0:11:55.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:58.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么感情? 约会吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:11:59.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 是约会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,和...和别人?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:05.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么叫"和别人"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:10.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟了!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:14.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,餐饮服务怎么拖了这么久还没来?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们继续聊吧 我得睡一会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好笑!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:27.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢开怀大笑! 笑起来...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:28.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,真有意思!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:35.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,能麻烦你回去吗?  这里是头等舱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不是针对你 不过我们可比你高贵多了!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:43.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 射门 得分 - 那是维瓦尔第吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:45.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 机舱奴隶 - 您有什么需要 马克维茨先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,用银盘子把我的坚果端上来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想问问 我们要的饮料好了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 人手不够
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那我还是回去... - 你身子在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:13:00.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是让我不爽! 能麻烦你回去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:03.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道这航班没有等级区分的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些所谓民主之类的东西都是一时的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.61,0:13:10.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去吃点菠萝吧 小可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,机长 看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:14.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,分析一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.39,0:13:18.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来这个小灯说明有什么异常 比如故障什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我倒是觉得一闪一闪的很漂亮 还有催眠效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:21.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,也对 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:23.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 里克?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞行手册!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们可能没燃料了 - 你怎么知道的?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:32.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一号引擎不转了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:36.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,二号引擎的火也熄了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,系好安全带 小伙子们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,别看 宝贝 情况可能变得很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:43.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,全体注意 我是机长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:47.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一个好消息和一个坏消息要宣布 好消息是 我们马上要降落了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:50.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,坏消息是 坠机啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:56.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们知道坐飞机这种事是难免的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:58.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢乘坐企鹅航空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:14.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,举手 莫里斯! 举起手来更好玩!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会飞哦!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:23.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次看来躲不掉了 我告诉你 你是我的真心朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 哥们 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:30.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那么 那事你也不介意吧?  - 什么事 随便说!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:32.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我摔坏了你的iPod!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:35.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,按键太小 我抓狂了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 惨绝人寰啊!  - 对不起啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了你 你这咬人屁股的混蛋!  - 真的是意外啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 意外啦!  - 混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你 格罗丽雅! 我一直爱着你!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:56.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像爱沙滩和读书那样的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:10.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 宝贝 你抖的像风中落叶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.57,0:15:12.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,里克 玩够了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:13.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,放下起落架
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢慢的 温柔的触地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:24.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,如飞鸟啄食 像温柔爱抚 就像你亲你妹妹那样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:27.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 温柔点!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:35.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在稍稍刹下车就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:38.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,执行紧急迫降 机翼向上! 拉!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:06.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:14.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞机哪去了? 你们把飞机怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:17.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事 我还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:21.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我连小睡一会都不行 这里哪是肯尼迪国际机场?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:23.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,科瓦斯基 伤亡报告
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有两名乘客失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:28.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果还不错嘛 干得好 小伙子们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:31.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁说企鹅不能飞的?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 你们这还庆祝? 看看飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:38.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们会修好的 - 你们要怎么修?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:41.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,勇气、口水还有一卷胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:45.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以在六到九月内修好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 六十九个月?!  - 不 是六到九个月
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:51.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,科瓦斯基 我们要化挫折为力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:55.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这个数字你是怎么得来的?  - 你负责重新装配
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:57.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是怎么估计时间的?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:17:01.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你 帅哥 你和你的朋友去挖个厕所先
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:04.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 谁说该你话事的?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:08.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么? 好吧 你负责 飞机你来修
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁说你有资格让我负责的?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:13.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 那么 还是我负责
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:15.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 你负责吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:18.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和你那些朋友别来妨碍我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:21.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,太对了 我也是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:25.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你很有自知之明嘛 - 听着 这事我们没完
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.57,0:17:27.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,高等哺乳生物 你们留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:30.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以用到你们的大脑皮层和可握拳的手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:34.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,菲尔 我该先用肥皂给你洗洗手的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:38.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,这到底...他们要怎么修好飞机?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,勇气和口水
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,很多的勇气和口水 众志成城之类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:46.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,听起来可不靠谱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:49.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,太对了 我们困在这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:53.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我们大家还在一起就没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:56.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 不过相亲相爱可没法送我们回家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:59.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,看 狮子!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:01.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大伙们 - 看够了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:04.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 伙计们!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:08.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们会帮我们的 - 等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:10.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们! 伙计们!  - 帮帮我们!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们停下来我就给你们签名!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:17.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识你!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:18.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,是那只讨厌的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:30.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,尝尝我的老娘拳吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:51.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有这招!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:18:59.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,正中要害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:02.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得老奶奶就不能照顾自己?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:06.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,下次我就不会对你这么客气了!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:08.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,开车
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:16.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗? 我们要求助你还去骚扰老太太?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,疯了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:21.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁才疯了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:24.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看看能不能打通 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:27.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,说我疯了 我们要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,消息E-4
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:44.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,用户已漫游出信号覆盖范围
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,请稍候再试
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:52.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我花眼了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些斑马...和我一样哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:20:00.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们在哪?  - 圣地亚哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次我有40%的把握
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:05.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我认识这里 - 我觉得是非洲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:06.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,非洲?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:11.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们祖先的摇篮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:13.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,这都藏在我们的血脉里 我能感觉到!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:16.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不仅仅是这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:19.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,...像是似曾相识 好像我来过这
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就叫寻根!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:22.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是 像是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:26.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,...似曾相识 像是我来过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是阿历克斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:41.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和我朋友们飞来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:45.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一个金属大鸟里飞来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后掉了下来!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:51.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,砸到地上!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.01,0:20:53.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘭!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:58.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后我们相遇了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:21:01.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只带来快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:03.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,和问候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:06.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是在演坠机吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 我们...没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:11.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来以为...对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:13.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是从保护区外面来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:16.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,远得很 我们其实从中央公园动物园来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:25.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,别勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:28.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:31.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说是从保护区外面来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:34.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能 从保护区外来的只有人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看起来很面熟 我认识你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:39.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么躲过盗猎者的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:41.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没见到什么偷猎者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你看什么?  - 我? 没看什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:46.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的水塘养不起闲人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:49.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们哪来的回哪去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:51.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这儿有什么经理负责吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我明白了 你是来挑战我的!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:56.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么? 我没有!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得是这么回事!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:00.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:02.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没看我有正事吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:05.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道 祖巴 你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:07.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:09.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:12.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 是阿历克斯 是"克斯" 纽约尼克斯的那个"克斯"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.03,0:22:15.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴 看!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.19,0:22:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我生来就有 兽医也查过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:20.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实是个很漂亮的胎记
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:22.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个记号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:25.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 气氛好像有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:29.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 他回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:31.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你终于回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.73,0:22:49.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:54.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈和爸爸? 妈妈和爸爸!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:58.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈和爸爸! 是我的妈妈和爸爸!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:00.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有妈妈和爸爸了!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:02.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我孩子还活着!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.68,0:23:04.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:05.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的孩子!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:09.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我儿子回来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.15,0:23:14.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯! 阿拉凯回来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.09,0:23:22.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯! 耶! 走失的儿子回来了! 太好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:25.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为你讨厌祖巴的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:30.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我是讨厌他 没错 我讨厌他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:32.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要利用阿拉凯 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.71,0:23:36.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要利用他来一劳永逸的除掉祖巴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:38.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 长羽毛的马!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开 让开路 躲开!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:42.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,纽约!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:47.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,有点像垃圾场 你确实这儿不是新泽西吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 纽约众! 你们的国王来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:52.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经举行欢迎仪式了?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.79,0:23:54.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫里斯 我觉得他们喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.73,0:23:57.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,和平移交政权 大家当然喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.07,0:24:11.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要意思 我是马蒂 我刚来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:20.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这群长得还真帅!  喜欢跑步吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.55,0:24:22.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 跑步超酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:25.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 超酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.83,0:24:28.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们原来和我一样说这种超酷的语言啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.93,0:24:31.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么? 你们这连医生都没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.43,0:24:32.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在没了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:35.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你们感冒了怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.57,0:24:38.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,蹲在等死坑里 等死咯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:43.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们真的需要个医生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:46.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你可以来当啊 - 你有兴趣吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.75,0:24:49.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我? 当医生?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.79,0:24:57.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿男人遍地跑 你们真幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:25:00.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么没个男人? 你长寄生虫了?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:03.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,早就没了 听着 姑娘们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.26,0:25:06.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,曼哈顿有两样东西紧缺 停车位和河马
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:09.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 大伙们 我刚发现
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.67,0:25:13.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来我儿子已经是一方王者了 纽约之王!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.61,0:25:18.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我们表演一下 儿子 别害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:21.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 这个动作总是迷倒一片
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.48,0:25:23.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗷!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.15,0:25:27.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,看 狮王发威了 狮王发威了!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.29,0:25:32.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们一起欢迎他回归狮群吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.83,0:25:37.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们群 马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.73,0:25:41.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直盼着能加入群呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.17,0:25:44.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我为人人 - 人人为我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.31,0:25:47.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看起来怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:52.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,准确的说 巫医鼻子上要穿一根骨头的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.18,0:25:55.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 只是卡上去而已
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.08,0:25:58.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊 他现在是一个巫医了!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.65,0:26:00.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我妈妈一定会为我高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.86,0:26:08.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,看那 我觉得摩托摩托喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:12.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:33.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 姑娘 你还真壮实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.69,0:26:35.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你后面跟着谁? 还是那只是你的大屁股?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:39.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不但壮实还很幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.46,0:26:41.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是摩托摩托?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我名字太好听了 所以要说两遍
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:46.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听喜欢的 大牛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:50.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,回见 姑娘 你可不难找 因为你真丰满
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.71,0:27:03.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想搅了你们的狂欢 祖巴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.32,0:27:07.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过狮群中有人想知道 你什么时候流放你的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.82,0:27:11.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 马库加?  - 其实没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.16,0:27:13.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过他们抱怨说阿拉凯还没通过...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.86,0:27:15.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,入群仪式之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.03,0:27:21.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以严格的说 他还不能加入狮群 这实在是没道理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都忘了入群仪式这事了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:26.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么? 入群仪式是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.21,0:27:28.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,是一个传统的成年仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.01,0:27:32.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,年轻的雄狮都要通过仪式来证明自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:36.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就像选秀那样?  - 没错 展示他们的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:39.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,表演才艺! 这事我驾轻就熟
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.62,0:27:43.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果是传统 那我一定要参加 展示才艺 证明自己
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.52,0:27:45.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想成为阿拉卡
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:47.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是阿拉凯 - 阿拉凯 这名字更帅
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:50.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们明天一早就举行仪式!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.43,0:27:53.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了 祝你好运 阿拉凯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.20,0:27:55.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我们那 我们说"奏凯"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是我好儿子!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.23,0:28:24.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,真漂亮啊 是不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.13,0:28:26.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,漂亮的让人窒息
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:28.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:31.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,...这才是该我们生活的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:35.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,游客陷阱行动开始!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:37.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我喜欢这个代号 真是好名字
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.34,0:28:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个行动得分好多步
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.14,0:28:40.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们真是群小坏蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.01,0:28:42.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.58,0:28:44.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:46.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,计划第一步 开始!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.50,0:29:03.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 看看我都干了些什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.27,0:29:04.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点 上钩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.67,0:29:07.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 看看这可怜的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.37,0:29:08.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,它死了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.11,0:29:12.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,计划第二步! 行动!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:22.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要给他一个生命之吻
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.06,0:29:25.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,里克!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:30.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,里克!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:33.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,倒档!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.73,0:29:34.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,油门!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.80,0:29:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,音乐!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.40,0:29:39.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 停下! 停下!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.07,0:29:42.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,停下!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.64,0:29:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,回来!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:48.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪个混蛋在放摇滚?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.75,0:29:56.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,她死了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.89,0:29:57.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.00,0:30:07.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些流氓!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.90,0:30:11.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊  你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.84,0:30:15.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士 我找到了你的手袋
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.11,0:30:18.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的手袋 你真是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.91,0:30:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,奶奶我没有手袋可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:23.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,老奶奶您还真硬朗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:26.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,扬克斯市416女童子军 报道!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.49,0:30:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家别惊慌 现在最好的办法 就是大家呆在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:33.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,等下一辆游客吉普车过来 可能要等几小时 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.03,0:30:35.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你去哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.03,0:30:40.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不会在这等野兽来享用!  奶奶我还没活够呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.93,0:30:45.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们想怎样随便  我得跟她一起去 老奶奶 等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.87,0:30:48.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托! 我们大家要待在...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.81,0:30:50.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,...一起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.28,0:30:53.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们就走这条路!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.61,0:30:55.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人想吃糖吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.95,0:31:02.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 慢点 - 注意脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:06.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们到了 你准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.63,0:31:10.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你小时候睡觉的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.96,0:31:12.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:19.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是我的吗?  - 看他高兴的 你看 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.74,0:31:23.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 还有这个 看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.98,0:31:26.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我记得这个!  - 他还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.31,0:31:28.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,比我想象中硬一点...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:32.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以前从来不睡床头 只睡床尾
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.19,0:31:34.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,是么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.65,0:31:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我留的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.99,0:31:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.86,0:31:42.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的小狮爪是最可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,小小的很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:47.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你走失那天留下的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.00,0:31:51.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 我那时真小
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.34,0:31:53.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,后来怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.67,0:31:58.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是我的错 就那一瞬间 我没看住你...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.28,0:32:00.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.55,0:32:05.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你爸爸真的尽力了 他曾经追寻那些盗猎者几个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:07.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,出了保护区很远很远
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:10.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后 我不得不认为那些盗猎者...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:12.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.36,0:32:15.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们觉得他们已经杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.03,0:32:20.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过他们果然都不是我儿子的对手吧!  谁都别惹纽约之王!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.63,0:32:22.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然了!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.37,0:32:26.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦 你们两个都别淘气 别打坏东西
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.04,0:32:30.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以前叫这个"飞飞"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.91,0:32:32.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞飞?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:34.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞飞
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.71,0:32:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他现在不需要了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.32,0:32:37.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我的飞飞
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.89,0:32:42.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴 你最好把飞飞给他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.99,0:32:47.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不用 谢谢 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.59,0:32:50.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,儿子 你早点睡觉 明天你有大事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.26,0:32:53.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要恢复体力
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.50,0:32:55.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会让欢呼声把房顶都掀翻的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.40,0:33:00.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望如此 否则你爸爸就不得不流放你了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.61,0:33:02.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会吧 妈妈 真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.34,0:33:05.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你会让我们骄傲的 你知道为什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.95,0:33:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你是我的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:12.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安 阿拉凯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:15.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的孩子 我亲生的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我儿子是个大王
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.76,0:33:22.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我儿子是个大王
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.77,0:33:34.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.31,0:33:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安 阿拉凯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.98,0:33:45.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞飞
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.98,0:33:48.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊  我的飞飞!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.92,0:33:52.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞飞 飞飞 我的飞飞
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:58.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,还没发现人烟 大家都很疲劳
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.46,0:34:00.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们好像迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.73,0:34:03.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,老奶奶 你知道你要去哪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.40,0:34:08.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道 不过我斗志昂扬 面带笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.14,0:34:10.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗 那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.81,0:34:15.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 终于看到人了 - 你们怎么在这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.75,0:34:18.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们能帮帮我们吗? 我们迷路了?  - 我们也迷路了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.48,0:34:23.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,太可怕了 黑白流氓闪电袭击 我们的车被他们抢去了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.22,0:34:25.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们的车也被他们抢去了啊 - 那我们怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.06,0:34:27.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么活下去?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.49,0:34:31.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有食物 没有水 没有地方住 我们到底该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.50,0:34:36.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们可以选择让自然征服你们
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.50,0:34:38.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也可以征服自然
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.44,0:34:45.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家围过来 孩子们 我们是纽约人 对不对?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.31,0:34:46.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.65,0:34:50.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在钢筋水泥的丛林里都生存下来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.18,0:34:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要食物时 我们去找热狗摊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.69,0:34:55.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是不是?  - 她说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.42,0:34:58.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要地方住的时候 我们建起了摩天大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.96,0:35:03.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 说的太好了 - 需要水的时候 我们建起了大坝
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.46,0:35:05.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是纽约人 我们自豪的高呼!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:08.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在纽约能做到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:10.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在任何地方都能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来了 朱利安国王
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.59,0:35:37.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,大坏鱼! 大坏鱼!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.60,0:35:41.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不对 是鲨鱼啊! 糟了糟了!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.27,0:35:46.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为什么要笑呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.67,0:35:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们凑齐了全部配件 不过进度有点拖延
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.11,0:35:56.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拖延程度如何?  - 六到九年
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.55,0:35:59.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 六十九年?  - 不是 是六到九年
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.22,0:36:02.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,小兵 我们的猴子呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.65,0:36:04.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们昨天开始就失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.79,0:36:06.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.69,0:36:11.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,竟敢在我眼皮底下溜号 小兵 你跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.30,0:36:14.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,里克 你跟我来!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.30,0:36:19.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要送他们上军事法庭 - 不必了!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.37,0:36:22.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们帮你们招募了些兄弟 机长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.48,0:36:31.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了 我成猴子军长了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.65,0:36:33.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.99,0:36:42.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,别浪费时间了 我们开始工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.39,0:36:46.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们分成三组 第一组负责制作机体
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.40,0:36:50.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二组负责装配 第三组负责后勤
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么问题?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.34,0:36:54.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有太好了 开始工作吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.18,0:37:05.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真想亲你一口 猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.35,0:37:08.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,勉为其难吧 虽然你长得丑
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.03,0:37:19.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住 小家伙们 真正的舞者是用心来表演的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.37,0:37:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要用心 你就战无不胜
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:25.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,随便你 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.87,0:37:29.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 阿拉凯 我刚好路过 过来给你鼓鼓劲
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.98,0:37:33.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不会紧张吧? 有吗?  - 哪有 我靠这吃饭的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.55,0:37:37.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我看来 胜利的关键在于选择对手
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:40.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以这是PK赛制吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.72,0:37:42.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- PK淘汰赛?  - 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.05,0:37:45.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了 我喜欢自由发挥
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.56,0:37:49.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁够格跟我比? 好让比赛精彩点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.23,0:37:52.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,这我可帮不上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:56.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为祖宗法纪不允许我多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.47,0:38:00.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过如果是我的话 我肯定选提西
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.74,0:38:04.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,提西 好吧 听起来蛮有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.24,0:38:05.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,马库加 对吧? 多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.01,0:38:08.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是祖巴的孩子嘛 随时效劳 上去露一手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.75,0:38:10.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,振作精神
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.75,0:38:12.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,五六七八
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.92,0:38:15.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们上 开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.61,0:38:36.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,成年仪式 现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:39.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 加油啊 宝贝! 让妈妈骄傲一下!  - 别这样 我正要主持...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:40.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题 妈妈!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.85,0:38:42.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁想第一个上场?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.68,0:38:45.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 哦 让我上 让我上!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.62,0:38:47.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,就你吧 又高又帅的这位
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.19,0:38:49.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,选择你的对手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.62,0:38:52.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.46,0:38:55.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要挑...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.06,0:39:00.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,...提西?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.07,0:39:04.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,提西? 他为什么挑提西?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:08.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是我儿子 勇敢无畏!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.97,0:39:10.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,来人 把他叫醒!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.42,0:39:27.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 提西 来吧 我们比试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:31.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 小提西 让我看看你的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.10,0:39:34.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 开始吧!  - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.13,0:39:36.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我警告你...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.17,0:39:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,...我可是霍西和罗宾斯的得意门生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是跳舞 是决斗!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.51,0:39:45.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,是斗舞吗? 没问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.58,0:39:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他是在跳舞吗?  - 他到底在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:56.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不可能是在跳舞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:59.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,比我想象中顺利多了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:04.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯 转身
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.26,0:40:08.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 老爸 应该是:  小跳、摆头、摇臀然后才是转身
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.21,0:40:19.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.05,0:40:23.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯 你受伤了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.55,0:40:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.48,0:40:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我赢了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.35,0:40:28.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然没有 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.75,0:40:30.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.89,0:40:34.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你告诉我说你是一方之王 大王可不会打输
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.03,0:40:39.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是大王 我是纽约之王
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:43.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我的艺名 我上台表演的时候用的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.60,0:40:44.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,表演?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.84,0:40:49.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,太不幸了 阿拉凯没通过测试
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.74,0:40:54.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁能想象 今天祖巴居然要流放...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.08,0:40:56.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,...自己的亲儿子?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.75,0:40:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.92,0:41:00.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴 要的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.09,0:41:04.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,很不幸 狮王必须要驱逐不合格的成员
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:20.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么 我不当这个狮王了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.11,0:41:22.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:25.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 不要! 你别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.21,0:41:30.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁能来接替祖巴的位置?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.78,0:41:32.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁来?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.28,0:41:35.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人吗? 没人?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:37.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:39.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,恐怕不是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.29,0:41:42.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然这样很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.63,0:41:46.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过这个重担还是我来担吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.80,0:41:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,提西 把帽子拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.80,0:41:55.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,作为新的领袖 我宣布流放阿拉凯!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.97,0:41:57.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,并且他要戴着耻辱之帽...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.24,0:42:00.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,...离开水源
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.31,0:42:03.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,期限为一千年 或者一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.15,0:42:06.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个长适用哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.72,0:42:12.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,过去 过去 走开!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.99,0:42:17.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该先告诉我们 你不是真正的大王 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.40,0:42:19.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也没先告诉我要决斗啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.86,0:42:21.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.23,0:42:25.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许你该说明白的 "儿子 那可是决斗哦! "
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:28.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不是狮子吗?  - 但是我这辈子都没打过架
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.74,0:42:30.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当然没有啦 你忙着跳舞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.71,0:42:34.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然还干别的事 问题是那个马库加给我下了套
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.85,0:42:37.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这些都不会发生 如果... - 如果你是只真正的雄狮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.68,0:42:39.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 祖巴!  - 是啊 我就这么说了!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.19,0:42:42.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,真正的雄狮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.86,0:42:45.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.53,0:42:50.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是多谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.97,0:43:01.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,锯子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.54,0:43:03.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,缝合线
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.71,0:43:07.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,擦汗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.31,0:43:08.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你挡住光线了 史蒂文
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.88,0:43:11.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你肩膀上有个褐色斑点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.78,0:43:16.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你观察真仔细啊 不过你看的再仔细一点 你会发现我全身都是斑点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.55,0:43:20.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,过几周 骨头就都长好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.33,0:43:22.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么我不用去等死了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.66,0:43:24.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然不用 蒂姆 你的人生才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.06,0:43:27.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗?  - 去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.57,0:43:31.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 马克维茨医生!  - 使劲玩吧 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.47,0:43:34.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个斑点有点像巫医病的症状啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.91,0:43:39.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么巫医病? 从没听说过有这么搞笑的病
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.58,0:43:42.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别问了 - 有人又淘气了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.68,0:43:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,放心 一点都不疼
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.92,0:43:50.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们上一个巫医乔 也得了这种病
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.25,0:43:54.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 然后呢?  - 星期一还在 星期三就挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.16,0:43:56.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,三天就挂了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.69,0:43:59.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于可以呼吸了 谢了 医生
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.26,0:44:03.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这巫医病居然是真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.50,0:44:07.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会想出办法的 你至少还有48小时能活哪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.11,0:44:09.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我从来没听说过这病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.27,0:44:12.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿连青霉素都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.61,0:44:15.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怎么都得先照个X光看看怎么回事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.11,0:44:18.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,找个狮子帮忙看看里面怎么回事吧 他们肯定乐意的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.16,0:44:30.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,噔噔!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.46,0:44:33.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他真厉害啊 - 真是酷毙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.73,0:44:38.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,这招你们肯定没见过吧 把纽约人都迷翻了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.97,0:44:40.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家试试看吧!  - 好啊好啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.31,0:44:43.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们可以尽管试
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.78,0:44:45.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过这可是我多年苦练的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.88,0:44:47.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得先锻炼你的嘴部肌肉到丰满有力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.98,0:44:52.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后你才可以把嘴巴撅成这样喷水
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.52,0:44:54.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.50,0:45:09.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,噔噔!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:16.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么会的? 简直一模一样!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.81,0:45:18.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你会的 - 我们都会
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.68,0:45:19.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,流淌在我们的血液里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.18,0:45:22.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还以为我很特别呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.98,0:45:24.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.45,0:45:26.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,号称自然原力的就是我们啦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.52,0:45:29.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 光芒万点 - 还有黑色条纹
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.25,0:45:31.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,一模一样!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.36,0:45:34.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.26,0:45:39.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来很不错 科瓦斯基 不过这东西能飞起来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:43.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 这里折一下 还有这里那里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.87,0:45:46.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.38,0:46:03.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我爸爸觉得我是个正废材
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.62,0:46:05.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我毁了我父母的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.62,0:46:07.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可太不酷啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.63,0:46:12.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,简直太衰了 我得弥补错误
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.56,0:46:13.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.73,0:46:18.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要跟你们说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:19.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.40,0:46:22.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们又没觉得 这地方真是太赞了?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.64,0:46:24.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我选"没觉得"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.41,0:46:28.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说 你们肯定不相信 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.58,0:46:31.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,...我跟摩托摩托约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.92,0:46:33.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是摩托摩托?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.48,0:46:37.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 他又壮又帅又壮!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.42,0:46:39.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你知道摩托摩托什么意思吗?  - 双胞胎?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.99,0:46:41.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,意思是"超帅超帅"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.96,0:46:43.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,"超帅超帅"?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.26,0:46:45.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啊 你什么时候变成非洲通的?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.20,0:46:47.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,流淌在我的血液里啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.43,0:46:51.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 我死了以后 你就可以尽情和帅哥眉来眼去了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.14,0:46:54.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病 梅尔曼 干嘛在我兴头上泼冷水?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.07,0:46:56.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我泼冷水的时候 你干嘛要在兴头上?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.31,0:46:59.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的兴头又没在你家门口!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.11,0:47:00.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.68,0:47:02.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,没在我家门口就好!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.25,0:47:04.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁稀罕你家门口!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:08.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以和你的超帅先生去...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.89,0:47:10.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么?  - 我们都在说什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.12,0:47:12.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 你就告诉她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.79,0:47:16.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,要告诉你告诉! 什么...告诉她什么?  你说什么? 我听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.69,0:47:18.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我走好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.16,0:47:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.63,0:47:23.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你少找我麻烦 - 梅尔曼! 格罗丽雅!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.30,0:47:27.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们不是朋友吗!  - 马蒂说的一点没错
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.71,0:47:29.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂?  - 马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.64,0:47:30.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.64,0:47:33.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.58,0:47:38.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是? 他是? 我觉得他是... 你是?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.65,0:47:41.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把那家伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.49,0:47:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,...当成我了?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.82,0:47:45.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是 哦 是 你们...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.66,0:47:47.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把我当成他了?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.16,0:47:50.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们确实长得很...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.23,0:47:52.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,很像啊 的确很像嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.96,0:47:56.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,声音一样 笑声一样 连说话方式都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.90,0:47:59.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,很奇怪啦 真的 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.07,0:48:03.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你是说我其实一点都不特别?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.41,0:48:05.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和其他斑马没两样?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.58,0:48:07.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然不是 你一定很特别嘛!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.51,0:48:08.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪儿特别?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.51,0:48:12.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 我分不出
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.02,0:48:15.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你可以考虑带个铃铛什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.89,0:48:18.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 铃铛?  - 好吧 这是个馊主意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.86,0:48:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我不如穿件T恤 上面写上"我旁边有个笨蛋"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.76,0:48:24.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不是笨蛋!  - 不是说你! 笨蛋! 他才是笨蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.53,0:48:27.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道嘛 你和马群打成一片的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.10,0:48:31.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我过着这辈子最倒霉的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.70,0:48:35.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你总是这么自我中心 是不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.37,0:48:38.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的麻烦比你的麻烦麻烦多了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.71,0:48:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是分不清你们俩 那又怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.21,0:48:44.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了 你就走吧 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.12,0:48:48.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,这你最拿手了 和在纽约时一样!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.45,0:48:51.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿 不过反正你分不出来 是不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.99,0:48:57.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的"真心朋友"希望你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.33,0:49:00.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好享受你那"比别人麻烦的多的麻烦"!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.26,0:49:03.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啊 走吧 我才不需要你帮我解决问题!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.90,0:49:07.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们千篇一律 我才认不出谁是马蒂!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.14,0:49:10.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是马蒂? 等一等 对了 我根本不在乎!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.24,0:49:12.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,帽子真好看啊 你这显摆鬼!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.42,0:49:19.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.75,0:49:22.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,...别走
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.59,0:49:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟上! 跟上!  跟上 跟上!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.26,0:49:28.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,看 玛瑞斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.83,0:49:31.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里建造我的行宫真是再好不过了!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.43,0:49:35.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,找人把这些坑填起来 废料都搬走
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.37,0:49:39.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这个头是谁丢的?  - 真浪费
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.94,0:49:42.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,还用你说 我在等死
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.27,0:49:45.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,病入膏肓了 知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.51,0:49:50.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能只有一两天好活了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:52.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来是个流浪汉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.78,0:49:55.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果朱利安国王 这是我的名字...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.79,0:49:57.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有还能活两天
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.29,0:49:59.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把我想做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.79,0:50:02.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 统统尝试下 - 哪些事情?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.36,0:50:05.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要成为一个口哨高手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.46,0:50:09.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我现在就很厉害了 不过我还要百尺竿头更进一步
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.80,0:50:11.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要吹口哨吹到死
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.14,0:50:25.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我还想做什么吗?  我要侵略邻国
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.48,0:50:29.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,把我的意愿强加给他们 不管他们愿不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.49,0:50:31.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,对你当然简单了 你是国王嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.66,0:50:35.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 你只是个等死的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.89,0:50:39.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过你死之前 肯定也有想做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.83,0:50:43.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是有一件事 - 什么事 告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.83,0:50:46.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦 我不能说 - 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.90,0:50:49.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直都没勇气告诉格罗丽雅 我对她的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.57,0:50:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么事情 告诉我!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.51,0:50:55.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直都没勇气告诉格罗丽雅 我对她的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.35,0:50:56.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对她多年的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.01,0:50:58.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 别告诉我!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.02,0:51:04.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,是女人的事情吗? 我可没听见啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.19,0:51:08.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你到底害怕什么? 反正你都要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:10.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.86,0:51:12.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.86,0:51:16.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要走到这个女人的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.20,0:51:19.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着她的眼睛 身体前倾
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.87,0:51:22.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,一点点就好 全靠过去也没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.71,0:51:26.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后你让她也靠过来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.71,0:51:30.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到你们之间只剩一个吻的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.21,0:51:33.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后你告诉他 你有多么讨厌她
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.22,0:51:38.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实 是多么爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.52,0:51:41.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 你这个小狡猾 大大的狡猾
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.73,0:51:45.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是个多情种子啊 听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.30,0:51:47.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要站起来 听见了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.23,0:51:49.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他没听见 - 我没听见你回答!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.30,0:51:52.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要站起来!  - 站起来!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.30,0:51:56.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 离开这个坑!  - 我站起来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他站起来了 玛瑞斯 - 我站起来了 玛瑞斯!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.64,0:52:01.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 站起来!  - 你要为这个女人站起来!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.31,0:52:03.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.75,0:52:06.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走到她的面前 - 告诉她真相!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.42,0:52:11.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要告诉她!  - 然后告诉她 "宝贝 我爱死你了"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.59,0:52:14.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,耶! 我要告诉她! 我要告诉她!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.93,0:52:17.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个快乐的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.66,0:52:21.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,摩托摩托
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.77,0:52:25.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,摩托摩托
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.34,0:52:28.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我 她爱我的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.44,0:52:32.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我 她爱我的大腿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.11,0:52:34.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我的球形身材
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.28,0:52:39.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我的又矮又胖 她爱我的丰满强壮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.45,0:52:43.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我的肌肉发达 她爱我的情趣浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.62,0:52:47.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我无时无刻 她爱我无休无止
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.79,0:52:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.63,0:52:51.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,她就是爱我...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.46,0:52:52.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,摩托摩托...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.30,0:52:56.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,...在我们关系更进一步之前
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.80,0:53:00.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想知道 如果我要留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.14,0:53:02.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想问你...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.81,0:53:07.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,让你的甜蜜小嘴 在我的耳边轻吟低语吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.71,0:53:09.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有很多问题要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.81,0:53:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证 答案都是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.32,0:53:15.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非你想要否定的回答
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.05,0:53:20.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么 你到底觉得我哪里好?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.06,0:53:23.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最丰满的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.99,0:53:25.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 还有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.00,0:53:27.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.73,0:53:30.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 你很壮实
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.67,0:53:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.01,0:53:37.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊 你真高大
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.61,0:53:38.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:40.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.68,0:53:43.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是无声胜有声吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.75,0:53:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,格罗丽雅!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.18,0:53:47.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,格罗丽雅!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.52,0:53:48.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.19,0:53:54.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 我想你见下摩托摩托
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.53,0:53:59.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,摩托摩托 哦 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.03,0:54:03.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 原来你们... - 没关系的 梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.73,0:54:05.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我接受你的道歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.34,0:54:10.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是么 太好了 我就是为这...好的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.04,0:54:13.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 那就这样吧 那我就...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.58,0:54:16.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了 我们忙着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.05,0:54:19.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.05,0:54:24.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 摩托托 你最好对这女孩好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.56,0:54:27.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你找到了这个世界上最完美的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.13,0:54:30.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我有这么幸运的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.73,0:54:34.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定每天给她送花 当然不是随便什么野花都行 知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.57,0:54:38.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,她喜欢兰花 白色的那种 早餐要送到她床上
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.57,0:54:40.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,六片小麦土司 两面都要涂黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.01,0:54:42.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,面包片要去掉 她不喜欢吃
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.91,0:54:46.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我愿意成为她最知心的朋友 在她伤心难过的时候给她依靠的肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.48,0:54:50.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我每天都会想着怎么让她开心
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.08,0:54:53.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,她有这世界上最美的笑脸
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.09,0:55:00.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我就会这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.42,0:55:02.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我不是 所以你要替我做了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.09,0:55:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.76,0:55:08.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,说什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.77,0:55:11.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,太感人了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.27,0:55:15.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了 我们说到哪了?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.61,0:55:16.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很"壮实"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.78,0:55:20.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,吓到你了吧 马库加?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.48,0:55:23.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来了结恩怨吧 像真正的雄狮那样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.78,0:55:28.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,这拳吃的爽不爽? 再吃一记 这是你陷害我的报应
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.19,0:55:32.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,这拳是因为你抢了我爸爸的工作 这拳是因为你羞辱了我全家
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.26,0:55:34.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我看起来像个笨蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.81,0:55:54.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,满意了? 你们就飞走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:56.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,懦夫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.32,0:56:09.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,水塘干了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.99,0:56:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,水塘以前从来没干涸过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.90,0:56:14.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这下大家都要等死了 - 这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.83,0:56:18.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开! 这是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.17,0:56:21.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,水塘干了 水不够喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.11,0:56:23.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 观察的很仔细嘛 雪莉 - 我叫鲍勃
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.51,0:56:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,马库加 我们该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.08,0:56:26.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.01,0:56:32.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 要解决危机 我们只有一个办法:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.02,0:56:34.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家来抢好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.82,0:56:37.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抢? 怎么能这样?  - 太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.86,0:56:40.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,太不公平了 你肯定赢嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.52,0:56:41.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这意思 雪莉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.03,0:56:43.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫鲍勃...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.59,0:56:46.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思 各位 生活本来就不公平 现在我话事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.20,0:56:50.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,多亏了阿拉凯 那位舞林大狮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.47,0:56:53.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托了 马库加 这是保护区里唯一的水源啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.07,0:56:58.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你渴了 你就得去保护区外找水源了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.38,0:57:00.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 保护区外面?  - 太危险了!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.74,0:57:02.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,盗猎者会把我们都杀掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.21,0:57:04.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,从来没有人离开保护区还活着回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.21,0:57:06.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我离开过!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.55,0:57:08.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是还活着?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.55,0:57:11.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.56,0:57:15.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就和水管堵塞差不多 纽约经常有这事 只要我们往上游走...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:18.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 上游?  - 离开保护区?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.16,0:57:19.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,就凭你?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.23,0:57:23.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 我会把水道疏通让水源恢复的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.43,0:57:28.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了 我可以帮你整理行李 不过看你戴帽子的衰样 我就知道你已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.57,0:57:34.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啊 你就笑吧 最好把你的毛都笑秃 我会证明你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.85,0:57:37.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你可以跳个舞求求雨什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.32,0:57:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴一定知道怎么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.92,0:57:46.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 祖巴在哪里?  - 你根本不在乎大家的死活
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.99,0:57:49.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴应该当领导 不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.76,0:57:55.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.60,0:57:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了谨慎起见 我会向祖巴咨询的!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.61,0:58:06.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.95,0:58:17.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.63,0:58:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.96,0:58:28.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.70,0:58:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的水果帽哪儿来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.63,0:58:32.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思 不好意思!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.14,0:58:36.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂在吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.81,0:58:38.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人看见马蒂了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.25,0:58:43.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.65,0:58:46.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你们看见他
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.38,0:58:48.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,请告诉他 他的朋友阿历克斯来跟他告别
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.89,0:58:51.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,告别? 别走嘛 你要去哪啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.72,0:58:55.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们可以去吗?  - 不行 这是我一个人的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.16,0:58:57.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能出保护区!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.74,0:59:10.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干什么呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.34,0:59:12.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们会连你帽子都抢的 - 盗猎者到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.51,0:59:15.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要去把帽子留下好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.08,0:59:16.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂! 我知道你在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.85,0:59:20.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,离开之前 我有些话想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.85,0:59:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一直都是个好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.19,0:59:27.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你总是帮我找到问题的积极面
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.76,0:59:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我却从来没有想过你也有自己的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.03,0:59:33.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你需要我的时候 我没有在你身边支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.03,0:59:35.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像在动物园时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.77,0:59:41.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这算哪门子的朋友?  真是逊毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.87,0:59:43.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想让你知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.54,0:59:46.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我的真心朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.88,0:59:48.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,太感人了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.78,0:59:50.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是太感人了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.55,0:59:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能转过身来 让我当面告诉你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.72,0:59:56.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到你了!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.05,0:59:59.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看到你了 没错 就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.72,1:00:01.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.73,1:00:05.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二十排左数第二百零三个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.06,1:00:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到你了 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.90,1:00:09.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道是你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.40,1:00:13.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道你特别在哪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:18.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们都是白黑相间的 而你是黑白相间的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.48,1:00:20.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个天生的梦想家 马蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.41,1:00:24.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,一直都是 而且你对音乐很有品味
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:26.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,交朋友却逊得很
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.08,1:00:30.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是说梅尔曼和格罗丽雅 我说的是我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.59,1:00:34.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 我跟你去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.09,1:00:36.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 你不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.49,1:00:38.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是你说了算的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.10,1:00:45.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那边有人类!  - 你们真是疯了 回来啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.10,1:00:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会抓住你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.11,1:00:50.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,帽子可别丢了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.04,1:00:52.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,帽子 永别了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.95,1:00:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,有水吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.95,1:01:00.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有 还是金子和钻石
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.06,1:01:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家别放弃希望
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.52,1:01:10.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家听着! 我来拯救你们了!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.49,1:01:13.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要水回来 出路只有一条
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.20,1:01:16.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 你们敬爱的国王朱利安
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.47,1:01:22.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要给我的好朋友水神们送点祭品就有水了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.47,1:01:25.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们就住在火山里!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.81,1:01:29.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,这有什么用?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:32.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么用? 问得好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.15,1:01:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要把我的祭品送进火山口
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.32,1:01:40.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的好朋友水神享用了祭品之后
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.66,1:01:42.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,"很好吃 谢谢你的祭品啊"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.89,1:01:45.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,"多吃点嘛" "不 我已经吃饱了"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.83,1:01:48.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,"你不多吃点就太见外了"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.27,1:01:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,"我已经吃饱了"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.77,1:01:53.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,"你看看你 瘦成这样" "我说我已经吃饱了 你聋了吗?! "
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.34,1:01:59.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,水神们享用了祭品了之后非常开心
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.54,1:02:03.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会给我水 我再把水给你们就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.41,1:02:04.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.12,1:02:06.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,有用吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.68,1:02:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然没! 我是说 当然有啦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.52,1:02:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说呢 莫里斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.35,1:02:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 一半一半吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.69,1:02:16.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们同意!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.53,1:02:18.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.53,1:02:23.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我需要有人到火山口里去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.47,1:02:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,当水神们的祭品
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.20,1:02:28.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人愿意去吗? 举手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.84,1:02:32.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 这里有没有还没找到过真爱...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.71,1:02:37.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,面对死亡无所畏惧的真心英雄?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.68,1:02:39.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我来当祭品吧!  - 梅尔曼?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.23,1:02:52.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶紧走 等大家都恢复理智可就不好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.96,1:02:55.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.23,1:03:00.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正我也还是将死之鹿了 如果我的死能求来水 我死也瞑目了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.24,1:03:03.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你脑子秀逗了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.07,1:03:05.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想你知道 在动物园的时候...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.84,1:03:09.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我能活下去的不是医生的处方
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.41,1:03:11.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,从来都只因为你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.58,1:03:14.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要每天都能看到你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.08,1:03:16.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就有活下去的勇气
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.92,1:03:21.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.99,1:03:27.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼! 梅尔曼! 梅尔曼!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.43,1:03:32.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你打算就这么一直生闷气吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.77,1:03:35.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,别和我哼哼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.54,1:03:39.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 祖巴 这是个奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.28,1:03:44.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的孩子回到我们身边了 你还不满意吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.21,1:03:46.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 雌性!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.28,1:03:51.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾失去过他一次 祖巴 我们不能再失去他了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.80,1:04:02.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.13,1:04:04.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 祖巴!  - 滚开!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.04,1:04:06.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有何贵干?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.77,1:04:07.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,出事了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.64,1:04:10.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,水塘干了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.44,1:04:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,干了? 不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.44,1:04:15.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,一滴都没剩!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.38,1:04:19.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是狮王 马库加 你有什么办法?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.22,1:04:23.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的儿子 阿拉凯 他说他能解决 他往上游去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.52,1:04:25.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他出了保护区了?  - 不会吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.19,1:04:27.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾想阻止他 我跟他说这纯粹是自杀
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.99,1:04:30.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是他一心想要证明自己给你看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.49,1:04:34.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你留在这 以防万一他回来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.00,1:04:38.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去啊 祖巴!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.94,1:04:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喉咙太干了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.18,1:04:52.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,这地方是不是越来越毛骨悚然了?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.42,1:04:56.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们分头走 找到问题所在 猎人们不会发现我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.02,1:04:58.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么这事只有我们做?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.02,1:05:02.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样我爸爸会觉得我...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.86,1:05:05.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想让他知道我是只真正的雄狮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.30,1:05:08.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你现在是什么? 巧克力狮子?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.53,1:05:13.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来难以置信 不过真正的狮子貌似是不跳舞的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.04,1:05:15.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.11,1:05:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少我爸爸是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.04,1:05:20.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,可你是个明星啊 至少人们是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.88,1:05:24.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是在纽约 这是在非洲 标准不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.11,1:05:26.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂 就是这里了!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.22,1:05:29.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这里堵塞了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.73,1:05:38.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,水都在这啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.06,1:05:43.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,注意隐蔽 看那边
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.90,1:05:46.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,一针正针 两针反针
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.30,1:05:47.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,是她
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.47,1:05:49.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这样对吗?  - 织的很好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.24,1:05:51.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,奶奶 你慢点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.24,1:05:54.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这都织成麻袋了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.08,1:05:56.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,别扯 让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.35,1:05:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要炸药 你有吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.08,1:06:03.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 糟了 我今天早上刚用完!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.36,1:06:07.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 野蛮人啊!  - 快执行躲避战术!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.36,1:06:09.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 蛇形躲避 用蛇形!  - 乌贼型躲避
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.79,1:06:12.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,锯齿形 锯齿形躲避!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.93,1:06:15.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,不对 不对 用乌贼型!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.60,1:06:16.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,残影躲避
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.93,1:06:19.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,太复杂啦! 章鱼型 章鱼型躲避!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.11,1:06:25.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快跑 马蒂!  - 我不能把你一人丢下!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.18,1:06:29.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,去找人帮忙! 用乌贼型躲避!  快点去! 用乌贼型躲避!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.78,1:06:32.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,残影躲避! 残影躲避!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.98,1:06:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,拯救我们!  我们爱你!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.12,1:06:38.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.79,1:06:41.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题 不怕
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.40,1:06:50.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拯救我们 - 梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.23,1:06:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们爱你 - 梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.04,1:06:53.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,拯救我们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.10,1:06:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题 跳下去就可以 不怕不怕
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.61,1:06:57.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 梅尔曼 - 我们爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.67,1:06:59.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 梅尔曼 - 拯救我们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.34,1:07:02.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来了 我来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.75,1:07:05.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么这么热闹?  - 乔?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.32,1:07:07.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,巫医乔? 我们以为你早死了!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.08,1:07:11.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也以为我已经死了 后来发现原来我全身都是斑点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.82,1:07:14.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么梅尔曼也没得绝症啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.16,1:07:17.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 梅尔曼没得绝症?  - 天啊 不会吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.16,1:07:19.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.43,1:07:20.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.00,1:07:24.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,别跳啊 梅尔曼 别跳 别犯傻!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.83,1:07:29.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在丢长颈鹿到火山里去求雨算是犯傻啦?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.77,1:07:30.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.34,1:07:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 梅尔曼 别跳啊!  - 格罗丽雅?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.38,1:07:39.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不能跳下去!  - 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.68,1:07:41.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.27,1:08:01.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是不能跳 梅尔曼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.21,1:08:03.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先 我的心都碎了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.14,1:08:07.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,其次 反正我只有18个小时可活了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.34,1:08:09.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,梅尔曼 一定要问清楚...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.05,1:08:13.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你跟我说的那些话 都是真心的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.55,1:08:15.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然是真心的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.29,1:08:18.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太离谱了 - 离谱吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.06,1:08:25.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,真正离谱的是 我居然只有在到了世界的尽头的时候...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.63,1:08:28.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,...才发现真爱其实...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.73,1:08:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,一直在我身旁
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.40,1:08:33.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来剩下的18个小时
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.97,1:08:36.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以没有遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.91,1:08:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,时间再短暂 真爱永流传
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.41,1:08:46.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 玛瑞斯 怎么回事?  - 胖妞找到真爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.75,1:08:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这儿怎么回事?  - 马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.85,1:08:53.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿历克斯有麻烦了!  我们快去上游救他!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.86,1:08:56.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 坐飞机去怎么样?  - 太好了 走吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.86,1:09:02.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,不满足我们的条件 大家就不开工
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.73,1:09:04.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样 给不给产假?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.50,1:09:07.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,产假? 你们都是爷们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.07,1:09:10.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要用飞机执行营救任务
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.64,1:09:13.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,工会没解体之前你们别想了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.64,1:09:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果还不把飞机修好 我就让你们都解体!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.08,1:09:21.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没看见这些民工正罢工呢吗?  没有产假!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.99,1:09:28.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许有人不希望这些照片流传出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.10,1:09:40.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 给你们产假
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.17,1:09:43.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,总算好了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.18,1:09:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们带我去哪?  你们要干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.51,1:09:55.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样 拜托了 别把我架在上面
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.52,1:09:57.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们搞错了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.25,1:10:00.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,看见没 你们都是"幸存者" (美国知名真人秀节目)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.89,1:10:04.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在 尝尝烤狮子怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.13,1:10:06.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能吃狮子
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.73,1:10:08.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 尝起来和鸡肉差不多
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.73,1:10:11.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要啊 别听她的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.87,1:10:14.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,她已经疯了 你们清醒点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.17,1:10:17.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是纽约来的啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.14,1:10:20.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我啊 我是中央公园的阿历克斯啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.22,1:10:29.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.15,1:10:34.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你脑袋被大象踩了么?  跑这儿来干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.39,1:10:38.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你躲在我后面
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.29,1:10:41.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们只是纽约人 有点粗鲁受了惊吓而已
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.73,1:10:43.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,躲在后面!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.40,1:10:45.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们还想不想吃晚饭了?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.74,1:10:55.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你搞什么? 儿子 - 看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.32,1:11:00.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.42,1:11:07.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 这些动作真眼熟
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.19,1:11:09.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,是阿历克斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.76,1:11:14.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是狮子阿历克斯啊!  - 中央公园的那只!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.33,1:11:16.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的是阿历克斯!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.77,1:11:19.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界上只有一只狮子舞跳的这么好!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.77,1:11:26.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,真帅啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.34,1:11:27.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.12,1:11:36.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他怎么做到的?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:50.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.63,1:11:53.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和儿子一起跳舞啊 我想是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.64,1:11:55.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要想 爸爸 要感觉!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.14,1:11:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,蝴蝶穿花!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.48,1:12:02.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉到了! 我感觉到了!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.16,1:12:16.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗷!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.17,1:12:29.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,跳的真不错 现在该吃饭了!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.51,1:12:30.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 当心!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.84,1:12:34.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.28,1:12:35.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿历克斯! 快上去!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.08,1:12:39.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,她手里有枪 快走啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.95,1:12:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 她手里有枪!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.68,1:12:44.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走! 传话过去!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.69,1:12:52.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说炸掉大坝让大家开心一下吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.43,1:12:55.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,机长 阿历克斯说要炸掉水坝
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.77,1:12:58.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题 他就来当炸弹吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.20,1:13:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 飞向水坝!  - 明白 机长!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.37,1:13:04.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油! 加油啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.21,1:13:13.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,回来! 那是我的晚饭!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.78,1:13:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,科瓦斯基 全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.05,1:13:19.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,音乐!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.12,1:13:22.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这首歌 - 经典就是经典
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.89,1:13:26.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,的确琅琅上口嘛 注意! 降低高度!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.56,1:13:31.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位抓紧扶稳 我们去搞垮水坝!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.24,1:13:35.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧啦 我们来啦!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.57,1:13:39.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉他们别这样! 升上去! 不然我们会死的!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.48,1:13:42.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯定有别的办法的! 传话过去!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.68,1:13:49.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说别爬升 让我们死吧 这是唯一的办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.15,1:13:51.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没搞错吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.75,1:13:56.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是舍生取义啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.59,1:13:57.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是真的! 医务兵!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.60,1:14:03.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,加速!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.50,1:14:09.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.94,1:14:13.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,讨厌的小猫
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.45,1:14:24.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道祭品怎么没效果
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.79,1:14:27.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,理论没错啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.52,1:14:32.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我不是口哨吹的太好的话 我自己就去当祭品了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.97,1:14:43.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,是您! 我找到您了!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.21,1:14:45.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫特?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.98,1:14:49.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,大坏鱼!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.66,1:15:01.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,水神不知道喜不喜欢海鲜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.89,1:15:03.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,拭目以待吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.99,1:15:06.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊  玛瑞斯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.76,1:15:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真灵验啊 - 我成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.83,1:15:13.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我成功! 我成功了!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.67,1:15:15.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 你立功了!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.91,1:15:17.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢! 太好了!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.80,1:15:44.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.37,1:15:47.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是阿拉凯!  - 是祖巴!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.37,1:15:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们成功了!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.21,1:15:52.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿拉凯 祖巴 你们成功了!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.55,1:16:00.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,祖巴! 阿拉凯!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.15,1:16:02.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们回来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.95,1:16:05.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们没事我真是太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.89,1:16:08.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.23,1:16:11.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.56,1:16:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我没记错的话 你不当狮王了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.40,1:16:19.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你 被逐出狮群了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.50,1:16:23.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以别指望你们能咸鱼翻身
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.51,1:16:28.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 您是大王 我们还专门给您带回来了礼物
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.58,1:16:30.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个雄狮味十足的包包 这在纽约可是很流行的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.91,1:16:33.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我真不知道说什么好 - 您带了可以尽显雄风 还能装东西
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.35,1:16:38.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,这背带可调的? 真不错 我散步时挎着可真是太时髦了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.75,1:16:40.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过你们还是要被流放
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.99,1:16:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们知道你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.93,1:16:47.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的包包!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.86,1:16:49.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这讨厌的小猫!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.24,1:16:54.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要啊! 不要啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.35,1:17:07.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你证明了自己 儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.45,1:17:10.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,这荣耀该是你的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.22,1:17:18.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 老爸 不过这该是你的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.46,1:17:20.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 儿子 是我们的!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.14,1:17:30.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的儿子! 纽约之王!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.97,1:17:33.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的好孩子!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.32,1:17:44.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,真爱超越一切界限
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.99,1:17:49.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我们在这里欢聚 见证这样的爱情
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.16,1:17:53.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管人生起落 你们是否都会终生厮守?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.07,1:17:58.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是"起"吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.67,1:18:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这对真是...好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.51,1:18:04.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会长久的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.51,1:18:07.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以亲下新娘吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.74,1:18:09.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然不行! 音乐!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.08,1:18:11.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 支架!  - 检查完毕!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.51,1:18:12.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 机翼!  - 检查完毕!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.75,1:18:14.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 钻石和黄金 - 检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.02,1:18:18.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见咯 - 我们会想你们的!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.75,1:18:19.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见啦!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.02,1:18:22.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,在蒙特卡洛度完蜜月后 我们会回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.03,1:18:24.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许是金子花光的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.09,1:18:26.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,早点回来!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.43,1:18:31.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈 让他们多玩会吧 反正纽约又不会跑 是不是 伙计们?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.53,1:18:33.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的没错!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.64,1:18:35.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我能和她在一起...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.64,1:18:39.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,...在哪都是天堂
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.71,1:18:42.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,她笑起来真美
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.05,1:18:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱果然是没界限啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.32,1:18:50.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来你得忍受我们一段时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.72,1:18:56.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸? 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.23,1:18:58.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得我们可以...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.33,1:19:03.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你骗到我了!  - 我骗到你了 儿子!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.73,1:19:07.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的招数都被你学去了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.07,1:19:11.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我骗到你了!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.34,1:19:14.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,老爹还不赖吧 是不是 马蒂?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.74,1:19:17.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂? 谁是马蒂?  - 少来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.25,1:19:20.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道谁是马蒂 - 你骗不了我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.58,1:19:22.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿没马蒂啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.85,1:19:27.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,马蒂! 我看你眼睛就知道是你啦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.36,1:19:30.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在流浪 永远在流浪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.69,1:19:33.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在找到一个家 像是在天堂徜徉
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.03,1:19:37.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在流浪 永远在流浪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.37,1:19:39.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在找到一个家
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.27,1:19:42.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 大家摇起来! 大家摇起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.44,1:19:46.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,摇起来呀摇起来!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:29.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well done, boys. Looks like ice-cold sushi for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:51.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, son. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:55.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,See the lion? Look at the lion and get the lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:01.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, son, if you're gonna grow up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:05.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,and be like your daddy someday, you gotta learn how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:06.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Da-da.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:11.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, Alakay, let me show you something, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:13.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see this mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:16.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and me are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:19.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,When you're bigger, you'll be Alpha Lion, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:22.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let me see you fight. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:25.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Alakay. No dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:28.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just amuse yourself, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:33.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a strange kid. You're a strange one. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, come on, let's try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Alakay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:40.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop that right now. Doggone it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:43.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so disappointing when they don't grow up the way you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:47.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Makunga. You're not challenging me again, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:51.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look on the bright side. After I defeat you and become alpha lion,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:54.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,you'll have more time to spend with your pathetic son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:02:00.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before I kick your butt, let me ask you:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:02.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to become the alpha lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:06.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm better looking, I have better hair, I'm deceivingly smart...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:08.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and I want everyone else to do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,We fight on three. One...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:17.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, Alakay. Daddy will show you how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:18.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who's the alpha lion? - You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:45.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:48.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that, Alakay, is how you attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:51.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:03:00.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it. Here, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,This one's a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:05.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll be worth a few bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:08.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Itjust gets easier and easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:12.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:14.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay! Alakay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:16.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:21.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Da-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:23.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:27.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:41.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Daddy! - Daddy's got you! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Da-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:13.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:57.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:30.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't like the looks of this guy. - He's kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:32.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's kind of a showoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think he's cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roar!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:53.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,The King of New York City...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:56.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Alex the Lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I still think he's kind of a showoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guy's an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:05.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe he should take a break. You know, we could all use a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:07.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, where would we go on vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:11.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but I want to go to Connecticut!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:15.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,On the loose, several animals, including the world famous Alex the Lion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:18.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,escaped from the Central Park Zoo tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.81,0:06:22.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,The escapees were cornered in Grand Central Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was a very bad kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:28.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Animal rights activists, who convinced zoo officials
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,to have the animals sent to Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:33.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,were stunned to learn that the freighter carrying the animals
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:35.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,was reported missing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:39.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tonight, hundreds of New Yorkers have gathered at the zoo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:42.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,to mourn the loss of their beloved zoo animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:46.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,The question on everyone's mind, where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:40.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Y'all know this one! It never gets stale!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:45.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you little fuzz buckets! You've been a great crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:48.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glad we could introduce you to the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:51.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you ever come look us up in Manhattan, feel free to call first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:55.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously though, call. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:59.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Settle down, everybody. Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't leave without this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprise, freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:06.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shake it! Shake it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:10.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm a lady! I'm a lady, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:14.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a lady! Not really! It's me, King Julien!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:18.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which of you is attracted to me? Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:26.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, freaks! You will be very glad to hear that I am coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you. It's my plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:38.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Until I return with the spoils from the new country...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:41.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Stevie will be in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:48.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think they like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:50.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Stevie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:53.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could we? No, you didn't say that! How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:01.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Naughty little thing! Stevie says...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let them eat cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:06.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,King Julien, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:10.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm all packed! I have a whole itinerary planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:13.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's Mort! He's so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let him on. Stop that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:18.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's carrying scissors and hand cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:25.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody in! Quickly, get in, get in! Get in quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:27.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Struts. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:28.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Flaps. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:29.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Engine. Coffee maker. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oopsie-daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:41.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,That has to be the second biggest slingshot I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it'll have to do. Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is your captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:48.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the event of an emergency, place the vest over your head
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,then kiss your... good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,New York City, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pray to your personal God this hunk of junk flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Personal God, hunk? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:00.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Open the door! I'm outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,If cabin pressure is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,place the mask over your face to hide your terrified expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:13.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss, aren't these supposed to be attached to my seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, sir. - OK, boys, launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:18.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:20.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Launch! - Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gremlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:09.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:14.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:18.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Somebody's dreaming. - I think I saw Mort on the plane wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got Madagascar on the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:21.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know I'm gonna miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:26.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was incredible. I think it'll seem more fun the further we are from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:27.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like when you bit me on the butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take that thing you're holding onto and use it onstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all part of my little actor's salad bar of emotional tidbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:39.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are the butts next to the croutons?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:46.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we get back, I might sign up for the breeding program.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:48.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Breeding program?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:51.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,We reach a point when we want to meet somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Settle down, have a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.87,0:11:55.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:58.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? Like dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:11:59.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Other... other guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:05.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, other guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:10.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:14.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is holding up that beverage service?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:17.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go check.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all keep talking. I'm gonna catch a few winks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:27.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like laughing! It's such a nice experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:28.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,To laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:35.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you mind going back? This is first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:40.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nothing personal. We're just better than you. Maurice, I'm open! Hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:43.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He shoots, he scores! - Is that Vivaldi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:45.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- In-flight slave. - Can I help you, Mr. Mankiewicz?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring my nuts on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were checking on our drink order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Been a little backed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I guess I'll go back... - Where's your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:13:00.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're freaking me out! Can you please go over there, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:03.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened to the separation of the classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this democracy thing is just a fad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.61,0:13:10.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll go out for pineapple, my bobbly-headed boobily-boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Skipper, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:14.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.39,0:13:18.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like a small bulb used to indicate something unusual, like a malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:20.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I find it pretty and somewhat hypnotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:21.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,That too, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:23.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right! Rico?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Manual!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Problemo solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:30.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We may be out of fuel. - Why do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:32.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've lost engine one...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:36.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and engine two is no longer on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buckle up, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't look, doll. This might get hairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:43.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Attention! This is your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:47.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have good and bad news. The good news is, we're landing immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:50.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,The bad news is, we're crash-landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:56.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,When it comes to air travel, we know you have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:58.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,But thanks for choosing Air Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:14.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Raise your arms, Maurice! It's more fun when you raise your arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:23.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,This could be it, Marty! I want you to know you are a one-in-a-million friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy! You're the best ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:30.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And you won't mind when I tell you... - Tell me anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:32.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I broke your iPod!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:35.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,The buttons were so small! It made me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The horror! - I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll kill you, butt-biter! - It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- An accident! - Butt-biter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you, Gloria! I always have!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:56.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like you love the beach. Or a good book. Or the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:10.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodness, doll, you're shaking like a leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.57,0:15:12.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico, you've had your fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:13.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gear down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gently. You just want to kiss the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:24.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a peck, a smooch, like you'd kiss your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:27.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said, kiss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:35.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now just a little brake. Just a touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:38.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I believe that's checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:48.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Commence emergency landing procedure. Flaps up! Deploy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:06.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:14.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened to the plane? What did y'all do to the plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:17.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm OK. I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:21.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't even sleep for a minute. This is not JFK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:23.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kowalski, casualty report.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two passengers unaccounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:28.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a number I can live with. Good landing, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:31.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who says a penguin can't fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:36.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, happy slappers! Is there some reason to celebrate? Look at the plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:38.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We'll fix it. - How are you gonna fix this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:41.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grit, spit and a whole lot of duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:45.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should be up and running in, say, six to nine months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sixty-nine months?! - No, six to nine months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:51.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kowalski, I say we use this setback to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:55.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where'd you get that number? - I want you to reconfigure the design.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:57.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you estimate that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:17:01.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pretty boy! Why don't you and your friends dig a latrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:04.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Who made you king of the plane wreck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:08.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me? Fine. You can be in charge. You fix the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who gives you the authority to put me in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:13.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, then I'll remain in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:15.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you will remain in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:18.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and your hippie friends stay out of our hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:21.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Correcto-mundo. Because I decided to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:25.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good for you. - Well, this discussion isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.57,0:17:27.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Higher mammals! Stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:30.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,We could use your front cortexes and opposable thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:34.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Phil! I should wash your hands out with soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:38.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,How in the hell-o will they fix this plane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, grit and spit and spit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,A lot of spit and grit and stick-to-it-iveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:46.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That don't sound too promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:49.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right. We're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:53.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,As long as we're together, we'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:56.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but love ain't gonna get us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:59.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Behold! The lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:01.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- People! - There is much to see. Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:04.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait! People!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:08.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They'll help us! - Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:10.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- People! Stop! - Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you stop, I'll autograph those!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:17.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:18.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the bad kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:30.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you like some of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:51.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in, Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:18:59.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right in the batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:02.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think an old lady can't take care of herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:06.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next time, I won't go so easy on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:08.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moving on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:16.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind? We need help and you harass old ladies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Out of my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:21.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's out of my mind now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:24.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- See if you can get an operator. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:27.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Out of my mind. We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Message E-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:44.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,The service user has roamed outside the coverage area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please try again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:52.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I trippin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,All those zebras... like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:20:00.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where are we? - San Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,This time I'm 40 percent sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:05.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I know this place. - I think it's Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:06.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Africa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:11.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our ancestral crib.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:13.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's in our blood. I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:16.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's more than that. It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:19.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,...deja vu, like I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:21.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like Roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:22.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:26.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,...deja vu, like I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:41.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me and me friends fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:45.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,fly in great metal bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then plummet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:51.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Smash ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.01,0:20:53.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:58.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then here we emerge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:21:01.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We offer only happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:03.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,and good greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:06.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is he dancing about a plane crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We just... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:11.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:13.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,You came from off the reserve?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:16.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Way off. From the Central Park Zoo, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:25.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't strain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:28.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:31.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,They say they're from off the reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:34.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. Only people come from off the reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:36.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look familiar. Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:39.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,How could you survive the hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:41.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We didn't see any hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you looking at? - Me? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:46.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,This watering hole doesn't need any more mouths to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:49.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,So skedaddle back to where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:51.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there a manager we could talk to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see. You're here to challenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:56.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? No! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what it looks like to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:00.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:02.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to take care of business...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:05.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, Zuba. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:07.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.85,0:22:09.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:12.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's Alex. Lx. Like New York Knicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.03,0:22:15.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.19,0:22:18.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've always had that. The vet checked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:20.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a beauty spot, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:22.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,A mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:25.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, this is a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:29.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Honey, he's come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:31.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:42.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.73,0:22:49.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:54.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad? Mom and Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:58.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad! It's my mom and dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:00.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a mom and dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:02.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,My baby's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.68,0:23:04.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:05.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,My son!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:09.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,My son is home!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.15,0:23:14.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay! Alakay has come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.09,0:23:22.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay! Yeah! The prodigal son returns. This is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:25.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you hated Zuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:30.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I do. I do. I do. I hate him. Oh, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:32.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to use Alakay, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.71,0:23:36.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use him to get rid of Zuba once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:38.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Giddy-up, feathered horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:41.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make way! Move out of the way! Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:42.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:47.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a bit of a dump. Are you sure we're not in New Jersey?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, New Yorkers! Your new king is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:52.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,This calls for a celebration!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.79,0:23:54.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maurice, I think they like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.73,0:23:57.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got to love a non-hostile takeover!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.07,0:24:11.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I'm Marty. I'm kind of new around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:20.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a good-looking group! You like to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.55,0:24:22.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Running is crack-a-lackin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:25.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right! Crack-a-lackin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.83,0:24:28.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys speak my crack-a-lackin' language.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.93,0:24:31.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? You don't have doctors here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.43,0:24:32.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:35.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what if you catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.57,0:24:38.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,We go over to the dying holes and we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:43.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys really need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:46.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We have an opening. - Would you be interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.75,0:24:49.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me? A doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.79,0:24:57.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's raining men. Hallelujah! You all got it going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:25:00.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why dont you have a man? You got worms?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:03.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got rid of those. Listen, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.26,0:25:06.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Manhattan is short on two things, parking and hippos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:09.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody! I just found out that my son
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.67,0:25:13.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,is a doggone king! The King of New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.61,0:25:18.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Show me some of your moves, son. Don't be bashful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:21.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. This one always knocks 'em dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.48,0:25:23.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.15,0:25:27.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out. The King is mad. The King is mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.29,0:25:32.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's welcome him back into the pride with open arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.83,0:25:37.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the herd, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.73,0:25:41.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me? I've always wanted to be part of a herd!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.17,0:25:44.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's one for all... - And all for all, y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.31,0:25:47.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:52.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Technically, a traditional witch doctor has a bone through his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.18,0:25:55.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry... it's just a clip-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.08,0:25:58.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Voila! He's a witch doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.65,0:26:00.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,My mother will be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.86,0:26:08.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out! I think Moto Moto likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:12.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:33.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodness, girl... you huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.69,0:26:35.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's your friend? Or is that your butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:39.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You as quick as you are hefty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.46,0:26:41.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you're Moto Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,The name's so nice, you say it twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:46.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,I kind of like it, fatso.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:50.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll see you around, girl. It won't be hard, because you so... plumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.71,0:27:03.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hate to be a party pooper, Zuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.32,0:27:07.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,but some of the lions were wondering when you plan to banish your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.82,0:27:11.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about? - It's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.16,0:27:13.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're griping that Alakay never went through
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.86,0:27:15.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,the rite of passage, blah, blah, blah,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.03,0:27:21.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,so technically speaking, he can't be a member of the pride. It's nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:23.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I forgot about the rite of passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:26.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's this rite of passage?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.21,0:27:28.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,A traditional coming-of-age ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.01,0:27:32.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Young lions earn their manes by demonstrating their skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:36.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A show-of-skill talent show deal? - Yeah. Strutting their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:39.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,A performance! I think that's up my alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.62,0:27:43.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,If it's tradition, I want to do it. Strut my stuff. Earn my mane.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.52,0:27:45.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to be Alaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:47.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alakay. - Alakay! Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:50.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,We will hold the rite of passage in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.43,0:27:53.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful! Good luck, Alakay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.20,0:27:55.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where Im from, we say, "Break a leg."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.23,0:28:24.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.13,0:28:26.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:28.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:31.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,...this is where we belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:35.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Operation Tourist Trap is a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:37.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.34,0:28:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,It works on many levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.14,0:28:40.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys are a bunch of suck-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.01,0:28:42.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That, too. - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.58,0:28:44.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:46.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stage one. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.50,0:29:03.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.27,0:29:04.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, take the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.67,0:29:07.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened? - Oh, look at the poor little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.37,0:29:08.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.11,0:29:12.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stage two! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:22.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will give him the kiss of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.06,0:29:25.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:30.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:33.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.73,0:29:34.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.80,0:29:36.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Music!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.40,0:29:39.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.07,0:29:42.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.64,0:29:43.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:48.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is all this rock'n'roll racket?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.75,0:29:56.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.89,0:29:57.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.00,0:30:07.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You hoodlums!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.90,0:30:11.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.84,0:30:15.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lady, I found your pocketbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.11,0:30:18.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,My handbag. Such a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.91,0:30:21.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nana can't survive without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:23.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are one tough cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:26.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Brownies Troop 416, Yonkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.49,0:30:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, nobody panic! The best thing we can do is stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:33.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for another tourjeep. It may take hours, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.03,0:30:35.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.03,0:30:40.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not staying here to be attacked by more animals! I'm too old to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.93,0:30:45.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going with her. Old lady, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.87,0:30:48.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please! We need to stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.81,0:30:50.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,...together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.28,0:30:53.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine! We'll go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.61,0:30:55.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does anyone want a hard candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.95,0:31:02.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Easy now. - Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:06.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,And right here... OK, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.63,0:31:10.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is where you always slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.96,0:31:12.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:19.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Was this mine? - Look at you. Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.74,0:31:23.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, this thing. Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.98,0:31:26.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I remember this! - He remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.31,0:31:28.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,A little harder than...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:32.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never slept on the right end. You always slept on the bottom end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.19,0:31:34.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.65,0:31:35.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that my?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.99,0:31:39.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.86,0:31:42.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You had the cutest little paws.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little, little bitty ol' paws.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:47.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did that the day we lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.00,0:31:51.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. I was so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.34,0:31:53.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.67,0:31:58.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was all my fault. I turned my back and...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.28,0:32:00.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.55,0:32:05.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your father did everything he could. He tracked those hunters for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:07.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Far off the reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:10.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Finally, I had to assume the hunters...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:12.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,...well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.36,0:32:15.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,We thought they'd killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.03,0:32:20.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,But my son fought them off! Dont mess with the King of New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.63,0:32:22.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.37,0:32:26.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,You boys be careful! Watch out before you break something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.04,0:32:30.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You used to call this "foofie."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.91,0:32:32.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Foofie"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:34.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Foofie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.71,0:32:36.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.32,0:32:37.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is my foofie!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.89,0:32:42.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba, you better give him his foofie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.99,0:32:47.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, no, thank you, thank you. It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.59,0:32:50.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Son, you get your rest. You have a big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.26,0:32:53.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll need all your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.50,0:32:55.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will bring the house down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.40,0:33:00.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope so. Otherwise, your father will have to banish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.61,0:33:02.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Mom, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.34,0:33:05.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you'll do us proud. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.95,0:33:09.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were born with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:12.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good night, Alakay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:15.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,My boy. My own boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,My son's a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.76,0:33:22.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,My son's a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.77,0:33:34.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good night, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.31,0:33:37.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good night, Alakay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.98,0:33:45.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Foofie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.98,0:33:48.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at foofie! My foofie!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.92,0:33:52.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Foofie, foofie, foofie. My foofie!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:58.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,No sign of civilization. Everybody appears very tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.46,0:34:00.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.73,0:34:03.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nana, do you know where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.40,0:34:08.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, but I'm going with a skip in my step and a smile on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.14,0:34:10.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure, right, OK. Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.81,0:34:15.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's people. - How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.75,0:34:18.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can you help us? We're lost. - We're lost too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.48,0:34:23.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was awful. A flash of black and white and they were gone. They took the jeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.22,0:34:25.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That happened to our jeep too! - What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.06,0:34:27.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,How will we all survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.49,0:34:31.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,No food, no water, no shelter. What are we gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.50,0:34:36.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can let nature get the best of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.50,0:34:38.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,or you can get the best of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.44,0:34:45.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gather 'round, children. We're New Yorkers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.31,0:34:46.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.65,0:34:50.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,We survive the concrete jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.18,0:34:53.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we need food, we hunt for a decent hot dog stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.69,0:34:55.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Am I right? - She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.42,0:34:58.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we need shelter, we build skyscrapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.96,0:35:03.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Exactly! - When we need water, we build a dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.46,0:35:05.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're New Yorkers, for crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:08.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we can make it there,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:10.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,we can make it anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, King Julien!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.59,0:35:37.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bad fishy! Bad fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.60,0:35:41.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, shark, no! Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.27,0:35:46.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why am I laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.67,0:35:54.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have all the parts we need, but we're slightly behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.11,0:35:56.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How slightly? - Six to nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.55,0:35:59.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sixty-nine years? - No, six to nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.22,0:36:02.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Private! What happened to our thumbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.65,0:36:04.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen them since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.79,0:36:06.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darn you, Darwin!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.69,0:36:11.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody goes AWOL on my watch. Private! You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.30,0:36:14.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rico! You're coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.30,0:36:19.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We'll bring them in for court martial. - That won't be necessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.37,0:36:22.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've recruited a few extra thumbs for you, Skipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.48,0:36:31.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be a monkey's uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.65,0:36:33.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.99,0:36:42.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough lollygagging. Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.39,0:36:46.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,There'll be three groups. Group Alpha will do sheet metal fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.40,0:36:50.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Group Bronson handles assembly. Group George Peppard, craft services.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.34,0:36:54.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good! Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.18,0:37:05.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to kiss you, monkey man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.35,0:37:08.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, but you're so darn ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.03,0:37:19.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember, little cub scouts, a great dance performance comes from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.37,0:37:22.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Straight from the heart, you'll never go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:25.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.87,0:37:29.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Alakay, I just happened to walk by, I thought I'd wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.98,0:37:33.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're not nervous, are you? - Nah, it's my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.55,0:37:37.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,In my opinion, the key to this is choosing the right competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:40.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean, this is like a dance battle sort of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.72,0:37:42.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Like a dance-off? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.05,0:37:45.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great. I love that. Freestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.56,0:37:49.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who'd be a good match for me? Just to keep things interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.23,0:37:52.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I wish I could help,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:56.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,but that's strictly against our ancient tradition and all we hold sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.47,0:38:00.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,But if it was me out there... I'd choose Teetsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.74,0:38:04.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Teetsi. OK. Sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.24,0:38:05.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Makunga, right? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.01,0:38:08.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything for Zuba's boy. Go get 'em, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.75,0:38:10.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shake it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.75,0:38:12.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,A five, six, seven, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.92,0:38:15.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.61,0:38:36.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let us begin the rite of passage ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:39.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, baby! Make Mama proud! - Woman, I'm trying to take...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:40.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,On it, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.85,0:38:42.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who will be the first participant?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.68,0:38:45.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me! Oh! Me, me, me! Me! Me! Me! Me, me! Please, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.62,0:38:47.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,How about you? The tall, handsome one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.19,0:38:49.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Choose your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.62,0:38:52.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.46,0:38:55.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll pick...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.06,0:39:00.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Teetsi?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.07,0:39:04.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Teetsi? Why did he pick Teetsi?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:08.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my boy! He's got some gumption there!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.97,0:39:10.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody, wake him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.42,0:39:27.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, so, Teetsi, come on. Let's do this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:31.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, little tsetse fly. Let's see your stuff. Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.10,0:39:34.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's dance! - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.13,0:39:36.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,But let me warn you that I am a protege of...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.17,0:39:39.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,...Fosse and Robbins!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not "dance" dance! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.51,0:39:45.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dance fight! You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.58,0:39:54.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is he dancing? - What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:56.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know that boy is not dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:59.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is even better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:04.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay, turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.26,0:40:08.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Pop, it's hop, shuffle, ball change, hip swish, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.21,0:40:19.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.05,0:40:23.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay! Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.55,0:40:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.48,0:40:27.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I... did I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.35,0:40:28.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.75,0:40:30.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.89,0:40:34.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You told us you were a king. A king does not get beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.03,0:40:39.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am a king. I'm the King of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:43.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's my stage name. Like for when I perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.60,0:40:44.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perform?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.84,0:40:49.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, this is horrible! Alakay has failed the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.74,0:40:54.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who would have ever imagined that today Zuba would have to banish...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.08,0:40:56.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,...his own son?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.75,0:40:58.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.92,0:41:00.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.09,0:41:04.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sadly, the alpha lion must cast out all failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:20.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then I'm no longer the alpha lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.11,0:41:22.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:25.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, no! You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.21,0:41:30.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who could possibly take Zuba's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.78,0:41:32.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.28,0:41:35.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone? No one?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:37.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:39.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.29,0:41:42.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I... this is all very awkward,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.63,0:41:46.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I suppose I could carry this tremendous burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.80,0:41:50.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Teetsi! Get the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.80,0:41:55.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,As your new leader, I hereby banish Alakay!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.97,0:41:57.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,He shall wear this Hat of Shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.24,0:42:00.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and leave the watering hole
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.31,0:42:03.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,for a thousand years, or life!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.15,0:42:06.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whichever comes last.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.72,0:42:12.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.99,0:42:17.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should have told us you weren't a real king, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.40,0:42:19.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never told me I'd have to fight anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.86,0:42:21.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.23,0:42:25.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know! Maybe a little fatherly advice like, "Hey, son, it's a fight!"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:28.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're a lion! - But I never fought another lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.74,0:42:30.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I guess not. You dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.71,0:42:34.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,And other stuff! Your pal, Makunga, set me up back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.85,0:42:37.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- None of this would have happened... - If you were a real lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.68,0:42:39.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Zuba! - Yeah, I said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.19,0:42:42.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,A real lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.86,0:42:45.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.53,0:42:50.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.97,0:43:01.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.54,0:43:03.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Suture.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.71,0:43:07.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Swab.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.31,0:43:08.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're in my light, Stephen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.88,0:43:11.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have a brown spot on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.78,0:43:16.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's very observant, Stephen. As you can see, I'm covered in brown spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.55,0:43:20.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK! That bone will be good as new in a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.33,0:43:22.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I don't have to pick out a dying hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.66,0:43:24.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you got your whole life ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.06,0:43:27.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Really? - Go out and grab it by the horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.57,0:43:31.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, Dr. Mankiewicz! - Break a leg! Sweet kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.47,0:43:34.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,This spot looks like Witch Doctor's Disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.91,0:43:39.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Witch Doctor's Disease? That's the most ridiculous disease I've ever heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.58,0:43:42.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't ask. - Someone's been knotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.68,0:43:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,This won't hurt a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.92,0:43:50.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Joe, our last witch doctor, had a spotjust like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.25,0:43:54.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And? - Monday, Joe. Wednesday, no Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.16,0:43:56.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wednesday, no Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.69,0:43:59.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can breathe! Thanks, doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.26,0:44:03.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,So this Witch Doctor's Disease is a real thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.50,0:44:07.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll find a cure. You've got at least 48 hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.11,0:44:09.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.27,0:44:12.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean... I dont have any penicillin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.61,0:44:15.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll need a CAT scan just to get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.11,0:44:18.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a lion look you over. They'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.16,0:44:30.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.46,0:44:33.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He has talent. - Stupendous and tremendous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.73,0:44:38.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bet you've never seen that one! Knocked 'em dead in New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.97,0:44:40.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's all give it a try! - Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.31,0:44:43.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you can try all you want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.78,0:44:45.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,but it takes years of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.88,0:44:47.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll never get a tight stream
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.98,0:44:52.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,until you build up your lip muscles to the point where you can
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.52,0:44:54.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,purse your lips like this. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.50,0:45:09.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:16.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you? You guys got it right out of the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.81,0:45:18.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- If you can do it... - We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.68,0:45:19.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's in our blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.18,0:45:22.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I always thought I was a bit unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.98,0:45:24.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are unique!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.45,0:45:26.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are like a force of nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.52,0:45:29.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A million points of light! - And dark stripes!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.25,0:45:31.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exactly the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.36,0:45:34.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.26,0:45:39.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks impressive, Kowalski, but will it fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:43.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. If we fold it here, here and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.87,0:45:46.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.38,0:46:03.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, man. My dad thinks I'm a total loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.62,0:46:05.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've ruined my parents' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.62,0:46:07.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,That is definitely not crack-a-lackin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.63,0:46:12.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is lackin' in the crackin', my friend. I've gotta fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.56,0:46:13.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.73,0:46:18.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,...there's... There's something I gotta tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:19.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.40,0:46:22.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this place great or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.64,0:46:24.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd go with "or what."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.41,0:46:28.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell you what. You're not gonna believe it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.58,0:46:31.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,...I got a date with Moto Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.92,0:46:33.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's Moto Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.48,0:46:37.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's so big and handsome and big!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.42,0:46:39.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Know what "Moto Moto" means? - Twins?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.99,0:46:41.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It means, "Hot Hot."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.96,0:46:43.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Hot Hot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.26,0:46:45.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,When did you start parlez-ing African?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.20,0:46:47.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's in my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.43,0:46:51.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you can flirt around with Mr. Hot Pants after I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.14,0:46:54.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, why am I the parade and you're the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.07,0:46:56.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you driving your parade under my rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.31,0:46:59.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll parade in another part of town!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.11,0:47:00.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.68,0:47:02.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Main Street's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.25,0:47:04.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:08.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you can take your hotee-tot float and Mr. Hotee Moto Moto...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.89,0:47:10.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about? - What are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.12,0:47:12.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, just tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.79,0:47:16.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? What are you... I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.69,0:47:18.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.16,0:47:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.63,0:47:23.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't get up on my account. - Melman! Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.30,0:47:27.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought you guys were friends! - Marty's absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.71,0:47:29.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Marty? - Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.64,0:47:30.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.64,0:47:33.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.58,0:47:38.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not? Oh! He was... I thought he... You're not him. He's... Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.65,0:47:41.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You thought that guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.49,0:47:42.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,...was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.82,0:47:45.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I mean, yes, you... Guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.66,0:47:47.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You thought I was him?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.16,0:47:50.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys kind of do look a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.23,0:47:52.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look a lot alike. Marty, you look a lot alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.96,0:47:56.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You laugh alike. Talk alike. He has the same speech pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.90,0:47:59.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a little weird, really. I mean, come on. Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.07,0:48:03.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you're saying there's nothing unique about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.41,0:48:05.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just like any other zebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.58,0:48:07.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Of course you're different!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.51,0:48:08.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.51,0:48:12.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, I can't tell you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.02,0:48:15.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could wear a bell or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.89,0:48:18.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A bell?! - OK, not a bell. Bell's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.86,0:48:21.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,How about a T-shirt that says, "I'm with stupid"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.76,0:48:24.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm not stupid! - Not you, stupid! Him, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.53,0:48:27.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, while you've been doing the prancing pony with your new posse,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.10,0:48:31.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been having the worst day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.70,0:48:35.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's always about you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.37,0:48:38.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,My problems are just a little bit bigger than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.71,0:48:41.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell you apart. So what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.21,0:48:44.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine. Run away, Marty! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.12,0:48:48.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what you do best! Just like back in New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.45,0:48:51.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm right here. But you can't tell that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.99,0:48:57.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your one-of-a-million friend hopes you enjoy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.33,0:49:00.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,your bigger-than-anyone-else's problems alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.26,0:49:03.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good, leave! I don't need you to help me solve my problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.90,0:49:07.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a dime a dozen! I can't tell which one's Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.14,0:49:10.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which one's Marty? Wait a minute. Oh, yeah, I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.24,0:49:12.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice hat, you showoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.42,0:49:19.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.75,0:49:22.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,...don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.59,0:49:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Giddy-up, giddy-up! Giddy-up, giddy-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.26,0:49:28.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Maurice!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.83,0:49:31.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,The perfect spot for my summer palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.43,0:49:35.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please fill in all these holes and relocate the riff-raff.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.37,0:49:39.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who'd leave a perfectly good head? - What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.94,0:49:42.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it. I'm in my prime here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.27,0:49:45.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm terminal, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.51,0:49:50.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I probably only have another two days left to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:52.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a bummer, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.78,0:49:55.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I, King Julien... that's my name...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.79,0:49:57.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,...only had two days left to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.29,0:49:59.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would do all the things
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.79,0:50:02.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I've ever dreamed of doing. - Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.36,0:50:05.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd love to become a professional whistler.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.46,0:50:09.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty amazing at it now, but I want to get even better,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.80,0:50:11.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,make my living out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.14,0:50:25.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what else I would do? I would invade a neighboring country
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.48,0:50:29.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,and impose my own ideology, even if they didn't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.49,0:50:31.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say. You're a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.66,0:50:35.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. And you are only just a sad little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.89,0:50:39.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,There must be something you want to do before you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.83,0:50:43.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There is this one thing. - What? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.83,0:50:46.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, I couldn't. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.90,0:50:49.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never told Gloria how I feel about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.57,0:50:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it? Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.51,0:50:55.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never had the guts to tell Gloria how I feel about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.35,0:50:56.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,How I've always felt about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.01,0:50:58.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine. Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.02,0:51:04.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it a woman? You didn't tell me it's a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.19,0:51:08.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you afraid of? You're a dead man anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:10.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.86,0:51:12.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.86,0:51:16.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got to march right up to this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.20,0:51:19.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look her right in the eye. Lean forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.87,0:51:22.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a little, or almost all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.71,0:51:26.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you let her lean forward a little until you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.71,0:51:30.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,...just lips' distance away from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.21,0:51:33.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you tell her how much you hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.22,0:51:38.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's more like love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.52,0:51:41.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you sly dog! Woof, woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.73,0:51:45.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a real player. Now listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.30,0:51:47.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got to rise up. You hearing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.23,0:51:49.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He didn't hear you. - I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.30,0:51:52.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You got to rise up! - Rising up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.30,0:51:56.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get out of the hole! - I'm rising out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:58.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's rising, Maurice. - I'm rising, Maurice!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.64,0:52:01.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Rising! - You go right up to this woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.31,0:52:03.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.75,0:52:06.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go up to her face! - Tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.42,0:52:11.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm going to tell her! - Then you say, "Baby, I dig you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.59,0:52:14.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm going to do it! I'm going to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.93,0:52:17.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love that happy little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.66,0:52:21.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moto Moto
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.77,0:52:25.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moto Moto
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.34,0:52:28.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,She loves me She loves my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.44,0:52:32.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,She loves me She loves my thighs
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.11,0:52:34.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,She loves my roundness
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.28,0:52:39.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,She love that I'm chunky She love that I'm plumpy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.45,0:52:43.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,She love my heftiness She love my zestiness
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.62,0:52:47.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,She love me restlessly She love me forever
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.79,0:52:49.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,She love me...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.63,0:52:51.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,...'cause she love me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.46,0:52:52.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moto Moto...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.30,0:52:56.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,...before things get too serious, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.80,0:53:00.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, if I were to, for example, stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.14,0:53:02.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,...I'd like to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.81,0:53:07.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let your candied lips be the messengers to my... ear canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.71,0:53:09.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have so many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.81,0:53:13.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise the answer will always be yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.32,0:53:15.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless no is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.05,0:53:20.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what is it about me that you find so interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.06,0:53:23.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the most plumpenest girl I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.99,0:53:25.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Other than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.00,0:53:27.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.73,0:53:30.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you know... you chunky.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.67,0:53:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.01,0:53:37.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,My gosh, girl, you huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.61,0:53:38.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:40.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.68,0:53:43.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't have to talk no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.75,0:53:44.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.18,0:53:47.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.52,0:53:48.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.19,0:53:54.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, I want you to meet Moto Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.53,0:53:59.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Moto Moto. Yeah, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.03,0:54:03.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I guess I... - It's OK, Melman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.73,0:54:05.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Apology accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.34,0:54:10.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. Yeah, right, that. That's why I... Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.04,0:54:13.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Well, that's it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.58,0:54:16.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good. We're kind of busy here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.05,0:54:19.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.05,0:54:24.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mototo, you better treat this lady like a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.56,0:54:27.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because you, my friend, you found yourself the perfect woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.13,0:54:30.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I was ever so lucky to find the perfect woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.73,0:54:34.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd give her flowers every day. And notjust any flowers. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.57,0:54:38.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Her favorites are orchids. White. And breakfast in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.57,0:54:40.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Six loaves of wheat toast, butter on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.01,0:54:42.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,No crust, the way she likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.91,0:54:46.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd be her shoulder to cry on and her best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.48,0:54:50.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd spend every day thinking of how to make her laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.08,0:54:53.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,She has the most amazing laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.09,0:55:00.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what I would do if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.42,0:55:02.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm not, so you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.09,0:55:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.76,0:55:08.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.77,0:55:11.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.27,0:55:15.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyways, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.61,0:55:16.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm "huge"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.78,0:55:20.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprised to see me, Makunga?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.48,0:55:23.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm here to set things straight, like a real lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.78,0:55:28.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this real enough for you? How about this? This is for setting me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.19,0:55:32.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is for stealing my dad's job! This is for humiliating my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.26,0:55:34.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,And making me look like a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.81,0:55:54.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Had enough? Sure, fly away!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:56.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.32,0:56:09.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,The water. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.99,0:56:11.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's never gone dry before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.90,0:56:14.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We'll need a lot more dying holes. - How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.83,0:56:18.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Out of my way! What is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.17,0:56:21.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,The watering hole is dry! There's barely water for one of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.11,0:56:23.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good observation, Shirley. - I'm Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.51,0:56:25.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Makunga, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.08,0:56:26.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.01,0:56:32.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen up! I'm afraid there is only one solution to this horrible crisis:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.02,0:56:34.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll all have to fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.82,0:56:37.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We can't fight for it. - That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.86,0:56:40.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not fair. You'd win!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.52,0:56:41.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exactly, Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.03,0:56:43.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Bob...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.59,0:56:46.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, folks, but life isn't fair. I'm in charge now,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.20,0:56:50.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,thanks to Alakay, the dancing lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.47,0:56:53.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, Makunga, this is the only water on the reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.07,0:56:58.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're thirsty, you'll have to look for water off the reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.38,0:57:00.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Off the reserve? - It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.74,0:57:02.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hunters would shoot us!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.21,0:57:04.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one leaves the reserve and survives!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.21,0:57:06.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,I left the reserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.55,0:57:08.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,And survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.55,0:57:11.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can do something about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.56,0:57:15.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like a clogged pipe, like we get in New York. I'll travel upriver...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.96,0:57:18.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Upriver? - Off the reserve?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.16,0:57:19.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.23,0:57:23.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll unclog the pipe and bring back your water.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.43,0:57:28.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great! I'd help you pack, but by the looks of that hat, I see you're all set!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.57,0:57:34.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine. Go ahead, laugh. Laugh your mane off. I'll prove you wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.85,0:57:37.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should try a little rain dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.32,0:57:44.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba would know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.92,0:57:46.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Zuba? - You don't care about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.99,0:57:49.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba should be in charge, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.76,0:57:55.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.60,0:57:59.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,As an added measure, I will consult with Zuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.61,0:58:06.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.95,0:58:17.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.63,0:58:24.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.96,0:58:28.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.70,0:58:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get the fruity hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.63,0:58:32.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.14,0:58:36.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi. Is Marty in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.81,0:58:38.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone seen Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.25,0:58:43.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which one of us is Marty?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.65,0:58:46.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Well, if you see him,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.38,0:58:48.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,tell him his friend Alex came to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.89,0:58:51.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodbye? Don't go. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.72,0:58:55.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can we come? - No. I have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.16,0:58:57.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't leave the reserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.74,0:59:10.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.34,0:59:12.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They'll get your hat. - Hunters are everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.51,0:59:15.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could you leave the hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.08,0:59:16.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty! I know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.85,0:59:20.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before I go, I got something I want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.85,0:59:24.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've been a great friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.19,0:59:27.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've helped me so often to see the bright side of my problems
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.76,0:59:29.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,that I never think of you having any.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.03,0:59:33.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wasn't there for you when you needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.03,0:59:35.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like back at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.77,0:59:41.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,What kind of friend does that make me? A pretty lousy friend, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.87,0:59:43.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just want you to know that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.54,0:59:46.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're one in a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.88,0:59:48.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.78,0:59:50.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.55,0:59:54.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,So could you turn around so I can tell you to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.72,0:59:56.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right. Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.05,0:59:59.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see you in there! Yeah, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.72,1:00:01.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.73,1:00:05.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twelfth row, two hundred and third from the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.06,1:00:07.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's you, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.90,1:00:09.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know it's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.40,1:00:13.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Know what makes you special?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:18.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,These guys are white with black stripes. You're black with white stripes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.48,1:00:20.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a dreamer, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.41,1:00:24.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Always have been. You have great taste in music
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:26.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,and horrible taste in friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.08,1:00:30.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, not Melman and Gloria, but me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.59,1:00:34.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.09,1:00:36.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty, you can't come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.49,1:00:38.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.10,1:00:45.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- People are out there! - You're crazy! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.10,1:00:47.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,The people will get you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.11,1:00:50.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't lose the hat!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.04,1:00:52.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye, hat!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.95,1:00:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any water?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.95,1:01:00.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, just more diamonds and gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.06,1:01:07.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.52,1:01:10.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen up! I will help you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.49,1:01:13.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to get your precious water.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.20,1:01:16.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I, your beloved King Julien
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.47,1:01:22.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,must simply make a small sacrifice to my good friends, the water gods,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.47,1:01:25.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,in the volcano!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.81,1:01:29.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,What does that do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:32.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What does that do? Excellent question.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.15,1:01:36.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,My sacrifice goes in the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.32,1:01:40.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,The friendly gods eat up my sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.66,1:01:42.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Thank you for the sacrifice."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.89,1:01:45.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Here, have another." "No, I've had enough."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.83,1:01:48.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,"I'll be insulted unless you have another."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.27,1:01:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,"I don't want another sacrifice!"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.77,1:01:53.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Look at you! You're skinny!" "No! I've had enough!"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.34,1:01:59.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,The gods eat the sacrifice. They are grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.54,1:02:03.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,They give me some water, and then I give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.41,1:02:04.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.12,1:02:06.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.68,1:02:09.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! I mean, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.52,1:02:11.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Maurice?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.35,1:02:13.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's fifty-fifty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.69,1:02:16.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.53,1:02:18.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.53,1:02:23.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now all I need is someone who would like to go into the volcano
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.47,1:02:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,and get eaten by gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.20,1:02:28.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any hands! Hands, anybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.84,1:02:32.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need someone, perhaps who has never found love,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.71,1:02:37.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,who could look death straight in the eyeball. A real, genuine hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.68,1:02:39.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll do it. - Melman?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.23,1:02:52.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Before we all come to our senses!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.96,1:02:55.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, what is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.23,1:03:00.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm dying anyway. If there's a chance it'll get you water, it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.24,1:03:03.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.07,1:03:05.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you to know, back at the zoo,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.84,1:03:09.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,it was never the doctors or prescriptions that kept me going.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.41,1:03:11.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was always you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.58,1:03:14.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seeing you every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.08,1:03:16.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what kept me going.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.92,1:03:21.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.99,1:03:27.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman! Melman! Melman!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.43,1:03:32.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You going to mope like this all day?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.77,1:03:35.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't "hmph" me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.54,1:03:39.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, Zuba. A miracle happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.28,1:03:44.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our son came back to us. How come that is not good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.21,1:03:46.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.28,1:03:51.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,We lost him once, Zuba. Let's not lose him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.80,1:04:02.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.13,1:04:04.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Zuba! - Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.04,1:04:06.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.77,1:04:07.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.64,1:04:10.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,The watering hole is dried up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.44,1:04:13.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dried up? That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.44,1:04:15.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.38,1:04:19.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're alpha lion, Makunga. What are you gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.22,1:04:23.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your son, Alakay, he said he could fix it. He's gone upriver.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.52,1:04:25.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Off the reserve?! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.19,1:04:27.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tried to stop him. I told him it was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.99,1:04:30.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was determined to prove himself to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.49,1:04:34.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You stay here, in case he comes back!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.00,1:04:38.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Zuba!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.94,1:04:43.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so parched.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.18,1:04:52.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this place starting to freak you out?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.42,1:04:56.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll slip in, find the problem. Hunters will never know we were here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.02,1:04:58.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are we doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.02,1:05:02.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe my dad will think I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.86,1:05:05.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to show him I'm a real lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.30,1:05:08.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,As opposed to a chocolate lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.53,1:05:13.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know this may sound hard to believe, but apparently, lions don't dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.04,1:05:15.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.11,1:05:17.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,As far as my dad is concerned.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.04,1:05:20.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,As far as people are concerned, you're a hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.88,1:05:24.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,In New York. This is Africa... much tougher crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.11,1:05:26.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.22,1:05:29.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the clog! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.73,1:05:38.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, there's the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.06,1:05:43.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay down. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.90,1:05:46.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Knit one, purl two.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.30,1:05:47.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.47,1:05:49.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is this right? - Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.24,1:05:51.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nana, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.24,1:05:54.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a little tangled, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.08,1:05:56.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, don't pull. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.35,1:05:58.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need dynamite. Got any?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.08,1:06:03.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap! I just used my last stick this morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.36,1:06:07.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Savages! - Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.36,1:06:09.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Serpentine, serpentine! - Squiggly squid maneuver!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.79,1:06:12.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zag, zig-zag, zig ziggy zag!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.93,1:06:15.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no! Squiggly squid!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.60,1:06:16.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Etch A Sketch!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.93,1:06:19.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's too complex! Octopus, octopus!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.11,1:06:25.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Run, Marty! - I can't leave you here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.18,1:06:29.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go get help! Squiggly squid maneuver! Go! Go! Squiggly squid!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.78,1:06:32.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Etch A Sketch! Etch A Sketch!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.98,1:06:37.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Save us We love you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.12,1:06:38.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.79,1:06:41.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, OK, OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.40,1:06:50.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Save us - Melman
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.23,1:06:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We love you - Melman
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.04,1:06:53.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Save us
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.10,1:06:55.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, here we go. OK, OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.61,1:06:57.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Melman - We love you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.67,1:06:59.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Melman - Save us
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.34,1:07:02.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.75,1:07:05.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's all the hoopla about? - Joe?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.32,1:07:07.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Joe the Witch Doctor? We thought you were dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.08,1:07:11.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,So did I. Then I realized I'm covered in brown spots.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.82,1:07:14.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,So Melman's not dying!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.16,1:07:17.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Melman's not dying! - Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.16,1:07:19.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.43,1:07:20.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.00,1:07:24.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do this! Julien, stop this! This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.83,1:07:29.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, suddenly throwing a giraffe into a volcano to make water is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.77,1:07:30.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.34,1:07:37.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Please, Melman! Stop! - Gloria?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.38,1:07:39.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't do this! - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.68,1:07:41.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.27,1:08:01.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't do this, Melman.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.21,1:08:03.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,First, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.14,1:08:07.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Second, I've only got 18 hours to live, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.34,1:08:09.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Melman, I gotta know...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.05,1:08:13.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,...did you mean those things you said about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.55,1:08:15.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.29,1:08:18.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's crazy. - It is?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.06,1:08:25.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's crazy to think I had to go halfway around the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.63,1:08:28.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,...to find out the perfect guy for me
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.73,1:08:30.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,lived right next door.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.40,1:08:33.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then it's you and me, neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.97,1:08:36.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and me for the next 18 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.91,1:08:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take whatever you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.41,1:08:46.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maurice, what happened? - I believe the fat lady has sung.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.75,1:08:49.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's going on here? - Marty!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.85,1:08:53.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex is in big trouble! We got to get upriver fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.86,1:08:56.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about the plane? - Perfect! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.86,1:09:02.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,The plane won't be fixed until the suits meet our demands.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.73,1:09:04.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, maternity leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.50,1:09:07.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maternity leave? You're all males.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.07,1:09:10.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need that plane for a rescue mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.64,1:09:13.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do until we bust up this union.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.64,1:09:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll bust up all of you if you don't get this plane going.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.08,1:09:21.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't you see these commies have my hands tied? No maternity leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.99,1:09:28.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe a certain someone wouldn't want these blowing around on the savanna.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.10,1:09:40.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. You get your maternity leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.17,1:09:43.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.18,1:09:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where we headed? What's going on? Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.51,1:09:55.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Please! Don't put me there! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.52,1:09:57.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.25,1:10:00.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see? You are survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.89,1:10:04.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, how about a nice lion casserole?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.13,1:10:06.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't eat a lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.73,1:10:08.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it tastes like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.73,1:10:11.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Don't listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.87,1:10:14.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's out of her mind, people!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.17,1:10:17.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm from New York City!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.14,1:10:20.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's me, Alex the lion! From Central Park!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.22,1:10:29.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.15,1:10:34.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, son? You got no business being out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.39,1:10:38.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.29,1:10:41.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're New Yorkers. They're just rude and frightened people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.73,1:10:43.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.40,1:10:45.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd let your dinner get away?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.74,1:10:55.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - The only thing I know how to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.32,1:11:00.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.42,1:11:07.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know those moves.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.19,1:11:09.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.76,1:11:14.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's Alex the lion! - From Central Park!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.33,1:11:16.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is Alex!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.77,1:11:19.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only one lion can move like that!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.77,1:11:26.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.34,1:11:27.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.12,1:11:36.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,How does he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:50.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.63,1:11:53.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm dancing with my son! I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.64,1:11:55.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't think, Dad. Feel!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.14,1:11:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.48,1:12:02.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling it! I'm feeling it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.16,1:12:16.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.17,1:12:29.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was beautiful. Now let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.51,1:12:30.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.84,1:12:34.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.28,1:12:35.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alex! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.08,1:12:39.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's got a gun! Get out while we can!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.95,1:12:41.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - She's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.68,1:12:44.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out while we can! Pass it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.69,1:12:52.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,He said let's have some fun and take out the dam. Basset hound.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.43,1:12:55.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Skipper! Alex wants to take out the dam.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.77,1:12:58.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right! But it's his funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.20,1:13:02.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hard to port! - Aye-aye, Skippy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.37,1:13:04.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.21,1:13:13.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back! That's my dinner!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.78,1:13:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kowalski, full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.05,1:13:19.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Music!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.12,1:13:22.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I like this song. - It never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.89,1:13:26.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It does have a catchy hook. Come about! Bring her in low!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.56,1:13:31.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold onto your skirts! It's dam-busting time!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.24,1:13:35.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, baby! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.57,1:13:39.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell them no! Pull up! They'll kill us!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.48,1:13:42.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's got to be another way! Pass it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.68,1:13:49.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,They say no pull up. Kill us. There's no other way. Basset hound.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.15,1:13:51.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.75,1:13:56.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Men, there is no sacrifice greater than someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.59,1:13:57.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Medic!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.60,1:14:03.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ramming speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.50,1:14:09.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.94,1:14:13.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bad kitties.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.45,1:14:24.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know why the sacrifice didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.79,1:14:27.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,The science seemed so solid.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.52,1:14:32.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd jump right in that volcano if I wasn't so good at whistling.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.97,1:14:43.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's you! I found you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.21,1:14:45.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mort?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.98,1:14:49.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bad fishy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.66,1:15:01.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the gods like seafood.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.89,1:15:03.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.99,1:15:06.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.76,1:15:10.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That was quick. - I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.83,1:15:13.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.67,1:15:15.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.91,1:15:17.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.80,1:15:44.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.37,1:15:47.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's Alakay! - It's Zuba!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.37,1:15:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.21,1:15:52.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alakay, Zuba, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.55,1:16:00.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zuba! Alakay!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.15,1:16:02.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're back!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.95,1:16:05.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.89,1:16:08.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.23,1:16:11.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.56,1:16:17.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Zuba, if I remember correctly, you quit the pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.40,1:16:19.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you were kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.50,1:16:23.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,So don't think that this changes anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.51,1:16:28.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right. In fact, we humbly present you with this token of appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.58,1:16:30.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,A man bag. Very popular where Im from.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.91,1:16:33.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't know what to say. - Still be tough and carry your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.35,1:16:38.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does the strap adjust? This will go very nicely for me when I go out hiking.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.75,1:16:40.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you're still banished.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.99,1:16:42.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,We figured you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.93,1:16:47.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,My handbag!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.86,1:16:49.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You bad kitty!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.24,1:16:54.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.35,1:17:07.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You deserve this, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.45,1:17:10.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.22,1:17:18.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dad. But this belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.46,1:17:20.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, son. To us!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.14,1:17:30.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,My son! The King of New York!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.97,1:17:33.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.32,1:17:44.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Love transcends all differences.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.99,1:17:49.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are gathered here today to celebrate such a love.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.16,1:17:53.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you take each other, for better or for worse?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.07,1:17:58.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,For better, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.67,1:18:02.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful, weird couple!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.51,1:18:04.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not going to last.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.51,1:18:07.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I kiss the bride?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.74,1:18:09.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Music!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.08,1:18:11.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Struts. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.51,1:18:12.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Flaps! - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.75,1:18:14.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Diamonds and gold. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.02,1:18:18.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bye-bye! - We'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.75,1:18:19.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.02,1:18:22.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll be back after the honeymoon in Monte Carlo,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.03,1:18:24.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,or whenever the gold runs out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.09,1:18:26.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.43,1:18:31.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom, let them take their time. New York isn't going anywhere, right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.53,1:18:33.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right about that!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.64,1:18:35.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with her...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.64,1:18:39.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,...and you two, I don't care where we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.71,1:18:42.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,She has the most amazing laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.05,1:18:47.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Love has no boundaries!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.32,1:18:50.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're stuck with us for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.72,1:18:56.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.23,1:18:58.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just thought we could hang out a bit and...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.33,1:19:03.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You got me! - I got you, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.73,1:19:07.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got me with my thing. You brought it back around on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.07,1:19:11.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got you, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.34,1:19:14.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,The old man's not too bad, eh, Marty?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.74,1:19:17.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Marty? Who's Marty? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.25,1:19:20.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know no Marty. - You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.58,1:19:22.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't no Marty here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.85,1:19:27.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marty! I can look into your eyes, and I know it's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.36,1:19:30.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, I've been traveling Been traveling forever
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.69,1:19:33.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,But now that I found a home feels like I'm in heaven
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.03,1:19:37.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, I've been traveling Been traveling forever
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.37,1:19:39.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,But now that I'm home
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.27,1:19:42.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Shake the hot things! Shake the hot things!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.44,1:19:46.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shake 'em! Shake 'em! Shake 'em!
